<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">ZIGUA Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Walamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Walm</para>
  <para style="mt1">Walamuzi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Walamuzi chalonga mbuli za Waizulaeli aho weze wapate uhuda wa nkongo mwe isi ya Kanaani. Icho chendaga chipindi cha kuvuzagiza ubanasi na kukombolwa. Mazuwa yamwenga Waizulaeli wakongaga kuvika matukulu. Niyo Chohile awegaila wantu wa si ntuhu chani ziwajele mwe nkunto. Aho wantu niyo wamwilila Chohile, aho Chohile niyo awenka wantu wetangwagwa Walamuzi chani wawalongoze na kuwakombola kulaila mwe izinkunto izo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kubula vino haluse, awandike ichitabu chino hamanyike. Wakale walozize waukula kugamba chitabu chino chawandikwagwa ni muwoni Samweli, mna vyadahika kutenda ni chindedi kugamba chitabu chino chawandikwagwa umo Waizilaeli wapataga kale seuta ywawo kwaviya viagiswa nkanana zilozize kugamba Waizilaeli hawendaga na seuta mwe ichipindi icho. Sula ya 17:6, na sula ya 18:1 na sula 19:1 na 21:25. Uneva Waizulaeli walawaga mo utumwa uko Misili mo mhilimo wa 1,400 Kulisito henati kwelekwa. Ino yalagisa mbuli zimwe chitabu chino zalailaga mo mhilimo uwo (Kaula nkongelo ye chitabu chikwitangwa Kulawa kwa kongezeza umanyi kugamba vyadahika Walamuzi walailaga mo mhilimo wa 1,300 Kulisito henati kwelekwa kubula mhilimo wa elufu imwenga na hamsini Kulisito heneti kwelekwa. Umo Sauli endaga seuta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli zimndani, chitabu chino chalonga nkondo ya uhelo na Wakanani aho Yoshuwa eze abanike naho chalonga mbuli ya chipindi Chohile awenkaga vilongozi na walamuzi chani wawalongoze na kuwakombola Waizulaeli sula ya 1 kubula sula ya 3:6.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iviya chitabu chino chalonga mwe mbuli ya walamuzi walozize awo Chohile egale chani wawambize 3:7-16:31.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iviya chitabu icho chalonga kumhituka Chohile kulozese Waizulaeli 17-21</para>
  <para style="ip">Uhelo chalagisa kugamba Waizulaeli nawakaunga seuta akumuwagila Chohile chani awalongoze kudamanya yakuwagila kulongozi kwa Chohile vikaleka kutenda na vilongozi wakudamanya yadya wakuwona kugamba yawagila kwawo wenye.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli eze abanike Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Yoshuwa eze abanike, Waizulaeli wamuza Zumbe Chohile, “Ni kabila dihi nadikonge kwita kuchigombela mwa wantu wa Kanani?” <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awahitula, “Wantu we idikabila dya Yuda awo nawakonge kwita kugomba nawo, kwaviya naniwadahize wakaitahe isi ya Kanani.” <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Wantu we idikabila dya Yuda niyo wawagamba walukolo weyawe, wantu we idikabila dya Simeoni, “Chitanye umo chikaita kuitaha iyo isi chinkigwe. Mnatenda ivyo suwe nachitanyanye na nyuwe umo mkaita kuitaha isi namwinkigwe.” Ivyo, wantu we idikabila dya Simeoni niyo wazumila kwambizana na wantu we idikabila dya Yuda.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Elo, wantu wa amakabila ayo amaidi niyo waita wakuwebunga. Zumbe Chohile niyo awenka uhuda mwa awantu wa Kanani na awantu wa Pelizi, wakoma wantu elufu mlongo kwe nkondo igombigwe komzi wa Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Mo mzi uwo wambwila seuta Adoni Bezeki, wagomba nkondo naye na kuwahuda Wakanani na Wapelizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoni Bezeki nendile akasumka mna wambalaza na kumgwila, niyo wamsenga amadole amakulu ya mwe mikono na mwe viga. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adoni Bezeki niyo agamba, “Maseuta milongo mfungate nikantile amadole amakulu ya mwe mikono na mwe viga nendile wakalogota nkombelezo hasi hemeza yangu. Haluse Zumbe Chohile kaniliha saviya niwatendele wowo.” Niyo wamwigala komzi wa Yelusalemu akubanikila uko.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu we idikabila dya Yuda wawahuda wantu wa Yelusalemu na Hebuloni na mizi miyuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Wantu we idikabila dya Yuda wawebunga umzi wa Yelusalemu na kuutaha. Wawakoma kwa mabamba awekazi wo umzi uwo niyo wautimpa moto. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Nyumani, wantu we idikabila dya Yuda niyo waita wakugomba nkondo na wantu wa Kanani nawakekala kwe isi ya amagulu ya Negebu ne isi ye idibwandasi. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Iviya, wantu we idikabila dya Yuda wawebunga Wakanani nawakele komzi wa Hebuloni, aho nkongo umzi uwo nauketangwa Kiliati Aliba, wayahuda amakabila ya Sheshai na Ahimani na Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osinieli ahuda umzi wa Debili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Yoshuwa 15:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kulaila uko wantu we idikabila dya Yuda niyo waita wakuwebunga umzi wa Debili, aho nkongo nauketangwa Kiliyati Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Kalebu niyo agamba, “Mntu yoyose nadahe kuutaha umzi wa Kiliati Sefeli, nanimloze mchiche ywangu Akisa.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Ivyo, Osinieli mwanawe dya Kenazi, Kenazi endaga mvunawe dya Kalebu, niyo autaha umzi. Kalebu niyo amlavya mchiche ywakwe Akisa asolwe ni Osinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa eze asolwe ni Osinieli, amgamba lombeza nkonde kwa tate Kalebu. Akisa kaita kwa tati yakwe akatenda kakwela mwe mpunda, eze asele hasi ise niyo amuza, “Waunga hwinke mbwani.” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Amhitula, “Nihingiza chisiku! Nakulombeza uninke sokwe za mazi kwaviya hantu uninkile uko Negebu kunyalisa.” Kalebu niyo amwinka izisokwe za kuchenya na hasi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhuda wa amakabila ya Yuda na Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Welekwa wa Keni endaga mkwewe dya Musa, nawatimilana na awantu we idikabila dya Yuda kulaila komzi we mitende, kugamba umzi wa Yeliko, kubula kwe idijangwa dya Yuda mwe Negebu hajihi na Aladi, niyo waika wikazi wawo uko hamwenga na awantu we idikabila dya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Wantu we idikabila dya Yuda waitanya na walukolo wawo, wantu we idikabila dya Simeoni, wawahuda wantu wa Kanani nawakekala Sefati. Waubalangisa umzi uwo niyo wawinka zina tuhu wawitanga Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Iviya wantu we idikabila dya Yuda wataha imizi ya Gaza ne izisi zimnkanda mwakwe na Ashikeloni ne izisi zimnkanda mwakwe na Ekiloni ne izisi zimnkanda mwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Zumbe Chohile awadahizaga awantu we idikabila dya Yuda, niyo wataha isi ya amagulu. Mna hawadahile kuwahuda awekazi we isi ye idibwandasi kwaviya myutuka yawo ya kugombela nkondo yendaga ya chuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Kalebu niyo enkigwa umzi wa Hebuloni kutimila amalagizo ya Musa. Kulaila uko Kalebu niyo agulusa nkolo ntatu za Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Mna awantu we idikabila dya Benjamini hawawabalaze wantu wa Yebusi nawakekala komzi wa Yelusalemu, nivyo vikuleka Wayebusi wekala hamwenga na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini komzi wa Yelusalemu kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idikabila dya Efulaimu na idikabila dya Manase wauhuda Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Wantu wa amakabila ya Efulaimu na Manase waita wakuwebunga umzi wa Beteli, Zumbe Chohile niyo awadahiza. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Nkongo wegala wapelembi waite wakaupelembe umzi wa Beteli. Mzi uwo mwe nkongo nauketangwa Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Wapelembi awo wawona mntu yumwenga akalaila komzi, niyo wamgamba, “Chilagise ivyo chikudaha kwingila komzi, suwe hachikukome.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Niyo awalagisa isila ikwingila komzi. Ivyo wengila na kukoma chila mntu endile umo. Mna niyo wamwasa mjima yudya mntu na wantu we ikaya yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Mntu uyo niyo asamila kwe isi ya Wahiti, uko niyo azenga mzi awitanga Luzu. Mzi uwo wetangwa Luzu kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu hewebalazwe ni Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Wantu we idikabila dya Manase hawawabalaze wekazi we imizi ya Beti Sheani ne ivijiji vyakwe na Tanaki ne vijiji vyakwe na Doli ne vijiji vyakwe na Ibulemu ne vijiji vyakwe na Megido hamwenga ne vijiji vyakwe. Wantu wa Kanani wajendeleza kwikala uko. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Hata umo Waizulaeli weze watende na nguvu hawawaguluse wantu wa Kanani mna wawenka ndima za kukunkuswa.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu hawawaguluse awantu wa Kanani nawakekala uko Gezeli, awo wajendeleza kwikala uko hamwenga na awantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Wantu we idikabila dya Zabuloni hawawaguluse awekazi wo umzi wa Kituloni na wekazi wo umzi wa Nahalali, wajendeleza kwikala hamwenga na Wakanani, wawenka wadamanye ndima saviya watumwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Wantu we idikabila dya Asheli hawawaguluse awekazi we imizi ya Ako na Sidoni na Ahalabu na Akizibu na Heliba na Afeka na Lehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Wantu we idikabila dya Asheli wekala hamwenga na wantu wa Kanani wekazi we isi iyo kwaviya hawawaguluse.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Wantu we idikabila dya Nafutali hawawaguluse awekazi wo umzi wa Beti Shemeshi hegu awekazi wa Besanati, mna wekala hamwenga nawo. Hata ivyo wekazi we imizi iyo wenkigwa ndima za chitumwa ni Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Waamoli wawagulusiza kwa magulu wantu we idikabila dya Dani. Hawawalekile weze wekale kwe isi ye idibwandasi. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Waamoli wajendeleza kwikala mwe imizi ya Aiyaloni na Shalibimu yendaga kwa kagulu ka Helesi. Mna awantu wa amakabila ya Manase na Efulaimu wawalongoza Waamoli na kuwatenda wadamanye ndima za chitumwa. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mhaka wa Waamoli wendaga ntendele ya chenya yo umzi wa Sela kujinkila lupwapwazi lukwita Akalimu na kujendeleza.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe uko Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Mndima ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo akulawa Giligali aita hantu hakwitangwa Bokimu awagamba Waizulaeli, Chohile agamba, “Siwalavyani kwe isi ya Misili na kuwegalani mwe isi niwelisize wababa zenyu. ‘Nagambaga sanijeze kuvuna lagano dyangu na nyuwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Nyuwe siwagambani msekudamanya lagano dyodyose na wekazi we isi ino, nambomole nchanja zawo za kuvikila.’ Mna lagizo dyangu hamditimile. Ni mbwani mdamanya mbuli zino? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Haluselo nagamba, saniwabalaze naho wekazi we ino isi mna nawatende saviya miwa mwenyu, milungu yawo naitende mtego kwenyu kwa kuivikila.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Mndima ywa Chohile eze awagambile wantu wose ulosi uwo, watula ndilo. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Hantu aho wahetanga Bokimu, kugamba ndilo, niyo wamlaviza malavyo Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Yoshuwa eze awalage Waizulaeli, chila yumwenga niyo aita hantu enkigwe hatende hakwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Waizulaeli wamsankanila Zumbe Chohile, mazuwa yose Yoshuwa akatenda mjima, na mazuwa yose ya wadya wadalahala wasigaile wawone ntendwa nkulu Zumbe Chohile awadamanyize Waizulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshuwa mwana ywa Nuni, mndima ywa Zumbe Chohile kabanika akatenda na mihilimo gana na mlongo. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Niyo wamhamba hantu enkigwe hatende hakwe uko Timnati Helesi kwe isi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu ntendele ya chenya yo lugulu lwa Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Wantu wose wo lweleko lwakwe iviya niyo wabanika, niyo lwatimila lweleko lutuhu helwimmanyize Zumbe Chohile, hegu ntendwa nkulu awadamanyize Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wamhituka Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Elo, wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wadamanya yehiye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, na kuvikila milungu ikwitagwa Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Wamwasa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa watati zawo, awalavize kulaila kwe isi ya Misili, niyo watimila milungu mituhu, milungu ikuvikilwa ni wantu wadya nawakela mnkanda mwawo. Waifikila madi imilungu iyo, niyo wamjelesa maya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Wamwasa Zumbe Chohile na kusankanila Mabaali na Mashitaloti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Zumbe Chohile niyo emukwa ni maya mwa awantu wa Izulaeli, awaleka wapolaganyi watahe ugoli wawo. Kawenkiza kwa wankondo wawo wawazunguluke, Waizulaeli niyo wadunduga kuwatowa. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Uko nawaite wakagombe nkondo, udahi wa Zumbe Chohile naukawahiga kuwegaila makwang'a, saviya awafundile na kwelisa. Niyo wengilwa ni chinyulu chikulise.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Vikaheza, Zumbe Chohile niyo awenka walamuzi, awo wawakombola Waizulaeli kulaila mwa awantu awo watahile ugoli wawo. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Mna hamwenga na ivyo vyose, Waizulaeli hawawetegeleze awo awalamuzi wawo, kwaviya wadamanya saviya wachilanga kwa kutimila milungu mituhu na kuifikila madi waivikila. Wasunguzisa kuleka kutimila watati zawo viya watimile imiko ya Zumbe Chohile, wowo hawadamanye seviya awo. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Chila nkanana Zumbe Chohile kawegaila walamuzi, naho Zumbe mwenye nendile akamdahiza uyo mlamuzi, awakombole mwa awankondo wawo mazuwa yose yo wikazi wa uyo mlamuzi. Chila nkanana umo Waizulaeli wakaila, Zumbe Chohile kawafila mbazi kulawana na masulumizo na kubunyaywa nawakadamanyizwa. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Mna chila nkanana mlamuzi uyo anabanika, wawiya lujendo lwawo lwihiye lwe chikale, wekala vihiye kujinka watati zawo. Watimila milungu mituhu waisankanila na kuifikila madi waivikila, ntendwa zawo hawazilekile hamwenga na unkani wawo.<verse eid="JDG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo awemukila maya awantu wa Izulaeli, agamba, “Kwaviya wano wantu wavuna lagano nidamanye na wababa zawo, walemela kutimila viya nilongile, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />miye, kukongela vino haluse saniguluse wantu wowose wadya wasigazwe ni Yoshuwa eze abanike. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Nanijeseze wantu we izisi izo chani niwajeze Waizulaeli niwone hegu nawauye mwe isila yangu saviya wababa zawo hegu bule.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ivyo Zumbe Chohile niyo awaleka awantu awo wa izisi ntuhu zisigale, hasunguze kuwabalaza, umo Yoshuwa akatenda mjima na umo eze abanike.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">1 Wantu wa izisi wasigaile mwe isi iyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo asigaza wantu wasiku wa izisi ntuhu mwe isi iyo chani awajeze Waizulaeli awo nendile hawanati kugomba nkondo mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Kadamanya ivyo chani awahinye wantu we ivyeleko ivyo umanyi wa kugomba nkondo kwaviya hawawone nkondo. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Awo wasigale mwe isi ni masekulu washano wa Wafilisiti na Wakanani wose na Wasidoni na Wahivi wasamilaga kwamagulu ya Lebanoni kulaila kolugulu lwa Baali Helimoni kubula Hamati. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Zumbe Chohile kawaleka awo chani ajeseze kuwajeza wantu wa Izulaeli awone hegu nawatimile imiko yakwe awalagize wadalahala wawo kujinkila Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Ivyo, Waizulaeli niyo wekala hamwenga na Wakanani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Niyo wasola wachiche wawo na kuloza wachiche wawo kwa wabwanga wa izo izisi na kuvikila imilungu yawo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli atenda chilongozi ywa Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wadamanya wavu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, wamjala Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, wavikila Mabaali na Maashela. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Ivyo maya ya Zumbe Chohile niyo yawemukila wantu wa Izulaeli, niyo awaleka wahudwe ni seuta Kushani Lishataimu ywa Mesopotamia niyo wamsankanila kwa mihilimo mnane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Mna Waizulaeli weze wamwilile Zumbe Chohile niyo awasaguila mntu ywa kuwakombola, uyo ni Otinieli mwana ywa Kenazi. Kenazi endaga mvunawe dya Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Ivyo, Muye wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwingila Otinieli atenda chilongozi ywa Waizulaeli. Otinieli niyo aita kwe nkondo, Zumbe Chohile niyo amwinka uhuda mwa seuta Kushani Lishataimu ywa Mesopotamia. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ivyo, isi niyo yatondowala kwa mihilimo milongo mine. Otinieli mwana ywa Kenazi niyo abanika.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi atimila kutenda chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wadamanya wavu vituhu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Zumbe Chohile niyo amwinka nguvu seuta Eguloni ywa Moabu chani awatowe wantu wa Izulaeli, kwaviya wadamanya wavu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Eguloni niyo awaduganya Waamoli na Waamaleki aita akugomba nkondo na Waizulaeli, kawahuda niyo ataha umzi we mitende, kugamba Yeliko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Waizulaeli niyo wamsankanila seuta Eguloni ywa Moabu kwa mihilimo mlongo na mnane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Mna Waizulaeli weze wamwilile Zumbe Chohile, niyo awegaila mntu ywa kuwakombola, uyo ni Ehudi mwana ywa Gela mta moso, mntu ywa kabila dya Benjamini. Waizulaeli wamsigila Ehudi egale majeleko yawo kwa seuta Eguloni ywa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi niyo asana sime yakwe, utali wakwe wenga futi imwenga na nusu. Niyo anyinya iyo isime mwe chigudi chakwe ntendele ya kulume mndani mwe izisuche zakwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Niyo amwigaila Eguloni yadya amajeleko. Eguloni endaga mntu adamanise. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi eze aheze kulavya amajeleko, niyo awagamba wantu wadya wenule amajeleko ayo wahalawe. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Mna yeye eze abule kwa amatukulu ya mayuwe yasongolwe hajihi na Giligali niyo auya kwa Eguloni amgamba, “Bwawe seuta naunga hugambile ulosi wako chinyele.” Seuta niyo awagamba wantu wanyamale, niyo wafosa kuse. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ehudi niyo amsogeila hadya ekale ichedu he chumba chakwe chihoile kwaviya chendaga chiyangazi, amgamba, “Hana ulosi wako kulaila kwa Chohile.” Seuta niyo enuka mwe difumbi dyakwe na kuchimala. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi niyo asomola isime yakwe no mkono wakwe wa kumoso kulaila ntendele ye diwambo dyakwe dya kulume, niyo amdidimika nayo mwe inda yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Sime ingila kundani hamwenga ne fimbo yakwe, mavuta niyo yagubika iyo isime kwaviya Ehudi hailavize naho ilaila kunyuma. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Akaheza Ehudi niyo afosa kwe chumba icho, na kuvugala izinyivi za icho ichumba kwa funguo.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi eze ahalawe, wandima wa uyo seuta niyo wauya. Weze wawone izinyivi zose zivugalwa, nawakafanyanya kugamba kata kuzunguluka umo mnyumba. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Wagojesa kubula wengilwa ni nkama. Weze wawone hakuvugula niyo waguha funguo na kuvugula ulwivi. Niyo wamuwona seuta ywawo kaumbala hasi kabanika.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Kuno wakagoja, Ehudi niyo asumka akajinkila kwa matukulu ya amayuwe aita Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Eze abule uko kwe isi ya akagulu ya Efulaimu niyo avila gunda, Waizulaeli niyo wasela hamwenga naye kulaila uko kwa magulu akatenda kawalongoila. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Awagamba, “Nitongelani kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kawenkani uhuda mwa awankondo wenyu Wamoabu.” Ivyo niyo wamtimila kubula he chomboko cha Yolidani Wamoabu wakombokela, niyo wachinda mntu yoyose asekujinka. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Zuwa idyo wakoma wantu wa Moabu wakubula elufu mlongo, wantu wose wagomba nkondo wajimbale na wata nguvu, hahana hata yumwenga ahonile. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Zuwa idyo Waizulaeli wawahuda Wamoabu. Isi niyo yatondowala kwa mihilimo milongo mnane.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaheza atimila Shamgali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Ehudi eze aheze kulongoza, Shamgali mwana ywa Anati niyo atoza hantu hakwe. Uyo kakoma Wafilisiti magana mtandatu kwa nkome ya kudimila ng'ombe. Uyo naye kawakombola Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">1 Debola atenda chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehudi eze abanike, wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wadamanya wavu vituhu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awatenda wahudwe ni seuta Yabini ywa Kanani nakekala uko Hazoli. Mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wakwe naketangwa Sisela mwikazi ywa Halosheti Hagoimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Seuta Yabini endaga na malingisha yakukweswa ni ng'ombe magana chenda ya chuma yakugombela nkondo. Kawadamanyiza yehiye vitendese wantu wa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo midi, niyo wamwilila Zumbe Chohile awambize.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Mazuwa ayo kwendaga na muoni ywa chivyele akwitangwa Debola mkaziwe dya Lapidoti, uyo endaga mlamuzi ywa Waizulaeli mwe ichipindi icho. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debola endaga akadamanyiza chitala chakwe hasi hemti wa mtende wendaga hagatigati hemizi ya Lama na Beteli mwe isi ya magulu ya Efulaimu. Wantu wa Izulaeli wambasaga chani awalamuile milosi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Zuwa dimwenga amwitangaga Balaki mwana ywa Abinoamu kulaila komzi wa Kedeshi kweisi ya Nafutali. Eze abule niyo amgamba, “Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, akulagiza kugamba, ‘Hita kawachisanye wantu wako kolugulu lwa Taboli, sagula wantu magana gana kulaila mwa amakabila ya Nafutali na Zabuloni. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Miye nanimtende Sisela mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Yabini, eze na wagomba nkondo na malingisha ya nkondo agombe nkondo na weye komto wa Kishoni, uko nomhude.’” <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balaki niyo amgamba Debola, “Uneva nawite hamwenga na miye nanite. Mna uneva hawite hamwenga na miye, sikwita.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola niyo amhitula, “Nivyedi, nanite hamwenga na weye, mna hopate ntogozi yoyose ya uhuda we inkondo iyo, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile namtende Sisela ahudye ni mvyele.” Ivyo Debola niyo waitanya na Balaki kubula Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Balaki niyo awetanga wantu wa amakabila ya Nafutali na Zabuloni uko Kedeshi, wantu elufu mlongo niyo wamtimila. Debola niyo waitanya naye.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Chipindi icho Mkeni yumwenga akwitangwa Hebeli, nandile kesunga na Wakeni weyawe awo welekwa wa Hobabu mnamuwe dya Musa, azikaga hema dyakwe hale uko kwendaga na mti ukwitangwa mwaloni wi Zanaimu, hajihi na Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Wantu weze wamgambile Sisela kugamba Balaki mwana ywa Abinoamu kakwela kolugulu lwa Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />niyo achisanya wagomba nkondo wakwe wose na malingisha yakwe ya nkondo ya chuma magana chenda, niyo akulawa Halosheti Hagoimu aita komto wa Kishoni. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debola niyo amgamba Balaki, “Hita! Dyelo nidyo idizuwa Zumbe Chohile nakwinke uhuda mwa Sisela.” Ivyo Balaki niyo asela kulaila kolugulu lwa Taboli alongoza wantu wakwe elufu mlongo. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Balaki niyo awebunga, Zumbe Chohile niyo awatibilinkanya Sisela na wagomba nkondo wakwe wose kulongozi kwa Balaki kwa bamba. Sisela niyo asela mwe dilingisha dyakwe, aguluka lwa viga. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Balaki niyo awatimila awo wagomba nkondo na malingisha yawo kubula Halosheti Hagoimu kawakoma wagomba nkondo wose wa Sisela kwa mabamba, hasigale hata mntu yumwenga.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Mna Sisela kaguluka lwa viga kubula kwedihema dya Yaeli mkaziwe dya Hebeli mntu ywe idikabila dya Keni. Kadamanya ivyo kwaviya kwendaga na lagano dya utondowazi mgati mwa seuta Yabini ywa Hazoli na wantu we inyumba ya Hebeli.<verse eid="JDG 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli niyo afosa amsingila Sisela, amgamba, “Sekulu ywangu ingila kwedihema dyangu Usekogoha,” Niyo engila kwedihema, niyo amgubika na bulangeti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisela niyo amgamba Yaeli, “Hapu ninka mazi niywe, kwaviya sikalukwa.” Niyo amwinka mele ukaleka mazi, vikaheza amgubika vituhu. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Iviya Sisela niyo amgamba, “Chimala holwivi lwe idihema. Mntu yoyose akwiza kukuza akagamba hano hana mntu yoyose, mgambe, hahana.” <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Sisela niyo agona fofofo kwaviya nakasokelesa, ahadya Yaeli, mkaziwe dya Hebeli, niyo aguha chijinji che idihema na nyundo, amsogeila mpalahole, niyo azika chiya ichijinji mwe ichinengo cha Sisela, chimponkola kubula momsanga, ivyo Sisela niyo abanika. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Umo Balaki eze abule akamlonda Sisela, Yaeli niyo afosa kuse amsingila amgamba, “So hulagise uyo ukulonda.” Balaki niyo engila mndani mweidihema dya Yaeli ambwila Sisela hasi kabanika, ichijinji che idihema chimwe chinengo chakwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Ivyo, mwedizuwa idyo Chohile kawenka uhuda wantu wa Izulaeli mwa seuta Yabini ywa Kanani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Waizulaeli niyo wahikiliza kumtowa seuta Yabini ywa Kanani kubula wamkoma.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya Debola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Mwe idizuwa idyo Debola na Balaki mwana ywa Abinoamu niyo wachema wakagamba,<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Vilongozi walaila kulongoza Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Wantu welavya kwa kunga kwawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Tegelezani, nyuwe maseuta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Tegani magutwi nyuwe wakulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Nanimchemele Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, wize ufose uko Seili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Wize usele kolugulu lwa Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Isi izingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Ulanga ulagaza mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Heye maingu niyo yalagaza fula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Magulu yasingisika kulongozi kwako weye Zumbe Chohile, hata ludya lwa Sinai luzingiza kulongozi kwakwe, Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mwa amazuwa ya Shamgali, mwana ywa Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mwe chipindi cha Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">ntambo naziduma kujinkila mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">watafi wajinkila mwe vipinka.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Walimi nawasila mwa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">kubula nalaila miye Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">miye hwinga saviya mami ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Wesaguila milungu mihya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">niyo kwatenda na nkondo mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Mna halondoke mta guha hegu nchingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">mgati mwa wantu elufu milongo mine wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Nawatunya masekulu wa nkondo wa Izulaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">welavize kwa kunga wenye mgati mwa wantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mtogoleni Zumbe Chohile!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Longani ulosi uno, nyuwe wakwela mpunda zing'aile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">nyuwe mkwila mwe vilago vya yombe kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">nyuwe mkujenda mwe sila longani ulosi uwo.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Chemani kujinka wachemi kwamasima ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Ulongeni uhuda wa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">uhuda kwa awalimi wakwe mwa Izulaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Aho wantu wa Zumbe Chohile waseile mwe zinchili.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Setuka, setuka, Debola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Setuka! Setuka, ucheme nchemo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Setuka, Balaki mwana ywa Abinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Waguhe wantu wako watahigwe kwe nkondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Wakankalu wasigaile wasela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">Wantu wa Zumbe Chohile waita wakugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">Na wantu wata udahi.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Kulaila Efulaimu wasela kwedikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Niyo watimila walukolo wawo wantu wa Benjamini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Kulaila Makili, wasela wakulu wa wagomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Kulaila Zabuloni vilongozi wakulise.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Wakulu wa Isakali watimilana na Debola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Wantu wa Isakali wakanuni kwa Balaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Wasunguza kumtimila kubula kwe dikolongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Mna mgati mwe izinkolo za Lubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">wendaga wakakalamiza vitendese.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Ni mbwani wasigaila kunyuma ne izingoto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Chani wetegeleze miluzi ya mdima ngoto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Mgati mwe izinkolo za Lubeni nendile wakewenegana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">kwendaga na kukalamiza kutendese.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Wantu we idikabila dya Gadi dyasigailaga ntendele ya kaidi ya Yolidani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Wantu we idikabila dya Dani, kwambwani msigaila mwe meli mazwa yalozize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Wantu we idikabila dya Asheli dyasigailaga kwe mpwani ye bahali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Nawekala hantu hakuchimaliswa meli.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Wantu we idikabila dya Zabuloni nawo wawambaze ujima wawo mwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Hata wantu we idikabila dya Nafutali wawambaza ujima wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Muntu mwinukile mwa kugombele nkondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Uko Tanaki, mpezo mwe izisokwe za Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">Maseuta weza na kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">Maseuta wa Kanani wagomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">Mna hawatahile chumbu hegu chintu chochose.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ntondo kwembingu zehanga kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">zikajenda mo ulamga, zigomba nkondo na Sisela.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Mabohwelo yo mto wa Kishoni yawazola na kuwegala hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Heye, mabohwelo yatendese yo umto wa Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Hikiliza kwita kulongozi chinguvu, weye muye wangu!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Falasi zidamanya sindo hadya zendile zikajata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">Zijendeleza kutowa kwa kupilika kwawo.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile agamba vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">“Welisizeni umzi wa Melosi”,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">“Welisizeni wekazi wakwe vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">Kwaviya hawezile kumwambiza Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">Hawezile kwamwambiza mwe nkondo ya Zumbe Chohile kugomba nkondo na wankondo wata nguvu.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yaeli ajimbikwe kujinka wavyele wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Mkaza Hebeli, mntu ywa Keni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Heye ajimbikwe kujinka wavyele wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Wakwikala mwa amahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisela kamlombeza mazi, niyo amwinka mele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">Kamwigaila mele yagonile mwe bakuli ya ntunyo.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kwa mkono wakwe umwenga katoza chijinji cha hema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">mkono wakwe wa kulume nyundo ya msani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kamhonda Sisela mo mtwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">kamtula na kumhonda honda ichinengo chakwe.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela kafunama, niyo agwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Kanyamala dwii heviga vyakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Aho afuname, naho agwele na kubanika!<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Nine dya Sisela kakaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Kasungila niyo afuzuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Ni mbwani lingisha dwakwe dikawa kubula?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Ni mbwani sindo za amalingisha yakwe zikawa kwivika?”<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Wavyele wata ubala wamhitula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">Niyo ajendeleza kweuzisa kwaivyo ahitulwe.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />“Vyadahika walonda na kusangana vintu watahile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Mchiche yumwenga hegu waidi, kwa chila mgomba nkondo yumwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Suche idamanywe kwa mazoya ya ngoto kwachausa cha Sisela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Suche idamanywe kwa mazoya ya ngoto italizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Na mitandio midi ihambigwe yamwe singo yangu.”<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Weye Zumbe Chohile wabalange wankondo wako wose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Mna wambuyazo wose watende saviya zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Umo dikatontomoka kwa ulangazi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Isi niyo yatondowala kwa mihilimo milongo mine.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s1">Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Waizulaeli niyo wadamanya wavu vituhu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Zumbe niyo awaleka walongozwe ni wantu wa Midiyani kwa mihilimo mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Wamidiyani watendaga na nguvu zitendese wawasulumizisa Waizulaeli, kwachausa icho Waizulaeli niyo wadamanya hantu hakwefisiza mwe mpanga na mabome kwamagulu watende nchinga zawo. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Chila nkanana Waizulaeli wakahanda mbeyu kwezinkonde, Wamidiyani na Waamaleki na wantu watuhu wakulaila ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa weza kuwebunga. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Wantu we izisi izo niyo waika lago mwe isi iyo, wawebunga na kubalanga ulozo wose we isi kubula komhaka wa Gaza, hawawasigazize Waizulaeli chochose, ngoto hegu ng'ombe, hegu mpunda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Wankondo wazwelaga kwiza walozese saviya sije, hamwenga na ng'ombe na ngamiya zawo na kwika wikazi mweisi ya Izulaeli, kwaviya nawalozesa waibalangasa isi ya Izulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Waizulaeli wasokezeswa ni Wamidiyani, Waizulaeli niyo wamlombeza Zumbe Chohile awambize.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Waizulaeli niyo wamlombeze Zumbe Chohile awosize izinkunto izo nawakenkwa ni Wamidiyani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awegaila muwoni, uyo niyo awagamba, “Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli agamba vino, ‘Siwalavyani kweisi ya Misili uko mwendaga watumwa, <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />siwakombolani mwe mikono ya Wamisili, na mikono ya wose nawakawazilani umo mkeza. Niyo nawagulusa wantu kulongozi kwenyu nakuwenkani isi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Niyo nawakumbusani, Miye ni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, naho msekuvikila milungu ya Waamoli, awo mguhile isi yawo, mna hamwivile viya nilongile.’”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo aita akwikala hasi he mti ukwitangwa mwaloni, mti uwo wendaga wa mntu akwitangwa Yoashi wo lukolo lwa Biezeli ywa uko Ofula. Gidiyoni mwana ywa uyo Yoashi, nakaheta ngano mndani mwe bome dya kufumbuila zabibu chani efise Wamidiyani wasekumuwona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo amlaila, amgamba, “Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na weye, weye mgomba nkondo hwikogoha.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidiyoni niyo amgamba, “Welewe sekulu ywangu, hegu Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na suwe, ni mbwani mbuli zose zino zichigwela? Ntendwa zakwe nkulu za maula zikuhi, wachisimuile wadalahala wetu, wakagamba, ‘Zumbe Chohile nuyo achilavize kwe isi ya Misili. Mna haluse kachidula, kachileka chihudwe ni Wamidiyani.’”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amhitukila, amgamba, “Hita kwa udahi uwo unanawo, ukawakombole wantu wa Izulaeli kulaila kwa Wamidiyani. Ni miye hukusigila.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidiyoni amhitula, “Welewe sekulu, nanidahe zeze kuwakombola Waizulaeli? Lukolo lwangu nulo lusokelese mo lukolo lwa Manase, miye ni msokezi vitendese mwa awelekwa we ikaya yetu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Nodamanye ivyo kwaviya, Miye nahudahize. Nowabinde Wamidiyani saviya wabinda mntu yumwenga.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidiyoni amgamba, “Hegu kunizumila nilagisa chilagiso chani nimanye chindedi ni weye ulongile na miye. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Hampu usekuhalawa hano kubula suya hwigaile jeleko dyangu na kudika kulongozi kwako.” Agamba, “Nanihumule kubula aho ukuwiya.” <verse eid="JDG 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidiyoni niyo aita kunyumba kwakwe, amalanya kabehela na migate heigwaduswe ya unga ukubula chilo mlongo umwenga, niyo ajela inyama iyo mwe ntangulu, msuzi kaujela mwe nyungu, niyo amwigaila hasi ho mti wo mwaloni, amwinka. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Mndima uyo ywa Chohile amgamba, “Guha inyama ne imigate wike muno mlanga mwa luno uluwe. Ukajika jela umsuzi mlanga mwe inyama ne imigate.” Niyo adamanya ivyo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Mndima ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo achulusa inkome yakwe, akufya idya inyama na idya imigate kwa mbulo ye nkome. Chipumpa, moto ulaila mwe diya idiyuwe, watikimya inyama ne imigate. Ahadya mndima uyo ywa Chohile niyo agila.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gidiyoni eze abunkula kugamba yudya ni mndima ywa Zumbe Chohile, Gidiyoni niyo alonga kwa kogoha agamba, “Naniluwone, weye Zumbe Chohile! Kwaviya simuwona mndima ywako ywa kwembingu, uso kwa uso.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Mna, Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba, “Utondowale, usekogoha. Hobanike.”<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidiyoni niyo amzengela Zumbe Chohile nchanja yakulaviza ntambiko, ainka zina, “Zumbe nuyo akwigala Utondowazi.” Kubula dyelo nchanja iyo iyuko Ofula, mzi wa wantu wakwitangwa Wabiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Chilo icho Zumbe Chohile amgamba Gidiyoni, “Guha injeku ya iso ina mihilimo mfungate. Tula inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko ya Baali, uwo ananawo tati yako, tula iditukulu dya Ashera ihajihi nayo. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Ukaheza unizengele miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko yedi na viya ikungwa hano hantu henukile. Ukaheza nilaviza ntambiko ya kutikimya ya idya injeku ukajeseza nkuni za diya iditukulu dya Ashela utuile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Ivyo, Gidiyoni niyo aguha wandima wakwe mlongo umwenga, adamanya saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe Chohile. Mna kwaviya nakogoha wantu we ikaya yakwe na wantu wa mo mzi, hadamanye na msi, kadamanya nechilo.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Wekazi womzi uwo mtondo weze wenuke, wawona inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko ya Baali itulwa na diya iditukulu dya Ashela dihaguhi nawo nadyo digwa. Naidya injeku nendile itikimywa mlanga mwe injanja yo kulaviza ntambiko izengigwe ahantu aho. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Niyo wauzana, “Ni yuhi adamanye imbuli ino?” Weze wazuzise niyo wabunkula kugamba, Gidiyoni mwana ywa Yoashi nuyo adamanye imbuli iyo. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Wekazi wo mzi uwo niyo wambasa Yoashi wamgamba, “Mlavye mwanawo chimkome, kwaviya kabogozola inchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko ya Baali na kutula iditukulu dya Ashela na dihajihi nawo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Yoashi niyo awagamba wantu wose wambasize, “Togolani! Mwamkanila Baali? Mwadaha kumgombela? Yoyose akunga amkanile nakomwe hekwinati kucha. Hegu Baali ni Chohile, lekani ekanile mwenye, kwaviya inchanja yakwe ibogozolwa.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Kukongela idizuwa idyo niyo wamwitanga Gidiyoni, “Yelu Baali” Nivyo kugamba, Baali ekanile mwenye, kwaviya kabogozola inchanja ya Baali.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Wamidiyani na Waamaleki na wantu watuhu nawakela kumpezo ko mto wa Yolodani niyo waika lago dyawo mwe idibwandasi dintendele ya ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Muye kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile niyo walongoza Gidiyoni. Gidiyoni niyo avila gunda awetanga wantu wo lukolo lwa Abiazali wambase. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Niyo asigila wantu waite kwe isi yose ya Manase wambase. Kasigila walosi watuhu wakawetange wantu wa amakabila ya Asheli na Zabuloni na Nafutali, niyo weza wahangana naye.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidiyoni niyo amgamba Chohile, “Hegu unaikombola Izulaeli kwajinkila miye, saviya ulongile, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />haluse naika mkota wa ngoto mo lwazo lo kuhetela ingano. Kunatenda du na mnyuzu kulanga ko mkota, mna ulwazo lose lunyala, aho nanimanye kugamba nowakombole Izulaeli kujnkila miye, saviya ulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Niyo vyatenda saivyo, kwaviya mtondo eze enuke, kafumbula mnyuzu wendile mlanga mo mkota kamemeza champa cha mazi. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidiyoni niyo amgamba Chohile, “Hampu usekunifila maya. Nakulombeza nilonge naho lumwenga du. Nakulombeza unilekeile nijeseze umkota uno nihime vituhu. Nakulombeza mlanga mo mkota mnyale, mna mo lwazo mtende na mnyuzu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Chilo icho, Chohile niyo adamanya saivyo, kwaviya mlanga mo mkota du nuwo mnyaile, mna ulwazo lose nendile kuna mnyuzu.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidiyoni awahuda Wamidiyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Yelu Baali, kugamba Gidiyoni na wantu wose wandile hamwenga naye wasunguza kwinuka, waika lago dyawo mwekolongo hajihi na sokwe ya Halodi. Lago dya Wamidiyani dyendaga intendele yawo ya chenya dibwandasi hajihi no lugulu lwa Mole. <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Gidiyoni, “Wantu wano unanawo walozesa kwangu, vileke niwenke uhuda mwa Wamidiyani. Waizulaeli wanase kweduvya kulongozi kwangu kugamba wekombola kwa udahi wawo. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Haluse, wagambile wantu kugamba, yoyose akogoha hegu akuzingiza auye kwakwe.” Gidiyoni niyo awajeza wantu elufu gana na milongo midi niyo wauya kwezikaya zawo, asigaila na wantu elufu mlongo.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Zumbe amgamba Gidiyoni, “Wantu awo wachei walozesa. Haluse wegale kudya kwe sokwe ya amazi miye naniwajeze. Mntu yoyose hunga hugambile, ‘Yuno naite na weye, uyo aite na weye, mntu hunga hugambile, Yuno asekwita na weye, mntu uyo asekwita na weye.’”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Ivyo, Gidiyoni niyo awegala kwe sokwe ya amazi. Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Gidiyoni, “Wantu wakunga walambite amazi saviya kuli, wapagule na wadya wakunga wafike madi wakanywa amazi kwa vigasa.”<verse eid="JDG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Uwazwa wa awantu wanywele amazi kwa kuteka ne mikono yawo na kulambita saviya kuli wendaga magana matatu. Mna watuhu wose wasigaile wafika madi umo wakanywa amazi.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Zumbe Chohile amgamba Gidiyoni, “Kwa awantu awo magana matatu wanywele amazi kwa vigasa naniwakombole Waizulaeli na kuwenka uhuda mwa Wamidiyani. Mna wantu wadya awatuhu wauye kwezikaya zawo.”<verse eid="JDG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Ivyo, Gidiyoni niyo aguha izinkande na amagunda ya wadya nendile wakauya. Niyo awalaga wauye kaya. Asigaila na wadya awantu magana matatu. Idilago dya Wamidiyani nendile dihebwandasi ntendele yawo ihaisi.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Chilo icho Zumbe Chohile amgamba Gidiyoni, “Hita ukawebunge kwelago yawo, kwaviya sikwinka uhuda mwawo. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Mna, uneva wogoha hita hamwenga na mndima ywako Pula. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Uko nawive mbuli wakulonga, wenawe nopate nguvu za kudaha kwita kuwebunga.” Usele kwe lago. Niyo aita na Pula mndima ywakwe kubula mwingilo we idilago dya wamizi.<verse eid="JDG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Wamidiyani na Waamaleki na wantu walaile ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa nawagona kwedibwandasi, nawalozesa saviya sije, ngamiya zawo nendile hazikuwazika, zilozesa saviya msanga wa mpwani.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidiyoni eze abule, amwiva mntu yumwenga amsimuila mnyawe sozi yakwe, amgamba, “Silota sozi. Siwona mgate wa shayili ukafingilita kubula kwelago dya Wamidiyani, niyo watunta idihema na kudihituila hasi hatenda kulanga.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Mnyawe amgamba, “Iyo yalagisa kugamba ni bamba dya yudya Mwizulaeli Gidiyoni mwana ywa Yoashi, Chohile kamwinka uyo uhuda mwa Wamidiyani hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wetu wose.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidiyoni eze eve intamulizi ya idya isozi na ivyo itapitwe, amvikila Chohile. Niyo auya kwe idilago dya Waizulaeli, awagamba, “Inukani chite! Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kachinka uhuda mwa wagomba nkondo wa Wamidiyani.”<verse eid="JDG 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Niyo awasanga wadya awantu magana matatu watende mafyo matatu, niyo awenka magunda na nyungu zina magala mndani.<verse eid="JDG 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Niyo awagamba, “Mnisinye na kudamanya saviya nanidamanye umo hasogeila idilago. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Aho nanivile idigunda, miye hamwenga ne idifyo dyangu, nyose vilani magunda kulaila chila ntendele ye idilago, mkaguta kwa izwi kulu, ‘Kwachausa cha Zumbe Chohile na kwachausa cha Gidiyoni.!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Chilo gati chikasogela, Gidiyoni ne idifyo dyake dya wantu gana weze wabule uhelo we idilago, umo wadimi Wamidiyani wakahokelana indima. Niyo wavila amagunda yawo na kutula ziya izinyungu nandile wananazo.<verse eid="JDG 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Mafyo yose matatu cha hamwenga niyo wavila amagunda yawo na kutula izinyungu zawo. Mwe imikono yawo ya kumoso watoza magala na imikono yawo ya kulume watoza magunda na kuyavila, wakagamba, “Bamba kwa chausa cha Zumbe Chohile na kwachausa cha Gidiyoni.!”<verse eid="JDG 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Niyo wachimala chila yumwenga hantu hakwe kuizunguluka idilago. Wagomba nkondo wa awankondo wawo wose wapangana kuno wakaguta.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Wantu wa Gidiyoni weze wavile amagunda yawo magana matatu, Zumbe Chohile niyo awatenda Wamidiyani wakonge kukomana wenye kwa wenye kwedilago. Wamidiyani wasigaile niyo wasumka kubula Selela ukahinga Beti Shita kubula komhaka wa Abeli Mehola hajihi na Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Wantu wa Izulaeli kulaila mwa amakabibila ya Nafutali na Asheli na Manase wose nawetangwa wawatimila Wamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidiyoni niyo asigila wantu kwe isi yose ya wagulu ya Efulaimu, wagambe, “Selezani muwebunge Wamidiyani. Wachindeni mtahe ivimto na umto wa Yolidanidani kubula Beti Bala.” Ivyo wagosi wose we idikabila dya Efulaimu niyo weza wautaha umto wa Yolidani na ivimto kubula Beti Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Niyo wawataha vilongozi waidi wa Wamidiyani, Olebu na Zebu. Olebu niyo wamkoma mo luwe lwa Olebu, Zebu naye niyo wamkoma mwe fumbuilo dya divai ya Zebu, umo wakawatimila Wamidiyani. Niyo wamwigaila Gidiyoni mitwi midi ya Olebu na Zebu ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolidani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s1">Wamidiyani wahudwa vitendese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Wantu wa Efulaimu niyo wamgamba Gidiyoni, “Ni mbwani kuchidamanyiza seivyo? Ni mbwani huchitange, umo ukaita kugomba nkondo na Wamidiyani?” Niyo wamfuzumila kwa ukali. <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Mna Gidiyoni niyo awahitula, “Mbuli nidamanye miye sicho chintu, kuligana na mbuli nyuwe mdamanye. Hata chiya ichidodo wadamanye wantu wenyu wa Efulaimu ni chikulu kujinka chiya chidamanye suwe idikabila dyetu dyose. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Chohile kawenkani uhuda mwa wakulu wa Midiyani na Olebu na Zebu. Togolani, miye sidamanya mbwani haliganywa na nyuwe?” Gidiyoni eze alonge ivyo maya yawo mwakwe niyo yasela.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Ivyo Gidiyoni na weyawe magana matatu niyo wabula Yolidani, waudeluka. Hata hegu nawasokelesa, wajendeleza kuwatimila wankondo wawo.<verse eid="JDG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Ivyo, niyo awagamba wantu wa Sukoti, “Hampu wenkeni migate wano weyangu, kwaviya wasokelesa, suwe chichei chajendeleza kuwatimila Zeba na Salimuna maseuta wa Midiyani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Mna, vilongozi awo wa Sukoti niyo wagamba, “Ni mbwani chiwenkeni migate nanywi hamnati kuwagwila Zeba na Salimuna?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidiyoni niyo awagamba, “Ni vyedi, mna Zumbe Chohile ana chidahiza kuwagwila Zeba na Salimuna, nanilabatule mili yenyu na miwa na mbigili kwedijangwa.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Ivyo, kulaila uko niyo awabasa wantu wa Penueli, awalombeza saivyo. Wantu wa Penueli nawo wamhitula saviya wantu wa Sukoti wamhitule. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gidiyoni niyo awagamba, “Aho naniwiye mpeho, mnala uno naniutule.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salumuna wendaga uko Kalikoli na wagomba nkondo wawo elufu mlongo na shano, awodu nawo wasigaile kulaila kwa wagomba nkondo wa ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa, kwaviya weyawe laki imwenga na elufu milongo midi wakomagwa. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidiyoni niyo atimila isila ya wata mayomme ikuhinga intendele ya ulailo wa zuwa ya Noba na Yogubeha, niyo awebunga awo wagomba nkondo, kwaviya nendile hawemalanye. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Maseuta wa Midiyani Zeba na Salimuna, waguluka wasumka, mna Gidiyoni kawebata niyo awagwila, wagomba nkondo wose niyo wengilwa ni nkama itendese.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Ukajika Gidiyoni mwana ywa Yoashi, niyo auya kulaila kwe nkondo, akajinkila kolupwapwazi lwa Helesi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Niyo agwila mbwanga yumwenga kulaila Sukoti na kumuza. Uyo mbwanga niyo amgambila amazina ya awo vilongozi na wadalahala wamanyikise wa Sukoti, chahamwenga wendega wantu milongo mfungate na mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidiyoni niyo auya kwa awantu wa Sukoti, awagamba, “Mwakumbuka viya mnibeile mkagamba, ‘Kwambwani chiwenke migate wantu wako wahwelese nanywi hamnati kuwagwila Zeba na Salumuna?’ Hayani elo, Zeba na Salumuna wano wehano.” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Niyo awaguha wadalahala wo mzi wa Sukoti na kuwenka kanyo wagosi wose kwa kutatula imili yawo kwa miwa na migili. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Ukajika niyo augwisa umnala wa Penieli na kuwakoma wantu wendaga momzi uwo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Niyo awagamba awo Zeba na Salumuna, “Wantu mkomile uko Taboli nandile wevivihi?” Niyo wamhitula, “Wendaga saivyo weye, kwaviya nawakawoneka saviya ni wana wa seuta.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Niyo awagamba, “Wantu awo wendaga walukolo wangu, chonka tombo dimwenga. Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, hegu hamwawakomile, hata miye sawakomileni nyuwe.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Niyo amgamba Yeteli mwanawe mwelekwa ywa nkongo, “Chimala uwakome.” Mna Yeteli niyo ogoha kulavya idibamba dyakwe, kwaviya endaga achei mbwanga mdodo du. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Zeba na Salumuna niyo wagamba, “Chikome weye mwenye kwa viya ino ni ndima ya mntu mjima.” Gidiyoni niyo achimala, awakoma Zeba na Salimuna, niyo aguha ugonde nawi mwezisingo ze izingamia zawo.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wamgamba Gidiyoni, “Weye utenda chilongozi ywetu, weye ukaheza, welekwa wako kwaviya kuchikombola kulaila kwa Wamidiani.” <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidiyoni niyo awagamba, “Miye saniwalongozeni hegu mwanangu, mna Zumbe mwenye nuyo nawalongozeni.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Akaheza niyo awagamba, “Naunga niwalombezeni chintu chimwenga, chila mntu aninke sitadi zimwamagutwi yenyu mtahile.” Wamidiyani wendaga Waishimaeli wavalaga sitadi za zahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Niyo wamhitula, “Nachikwinke kwa kunga wenye.” Niyo watandika suche zawo hasi, wajela umo chila mntu izisitadi watahile. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Uzami we izisitadi izo aungile wamwinke wendaga chilo milongo midi. Ukaleka ivyo, kenkigwa ugonde na suche za langi ya zambalau wavalaga awo amaseuta wa Midiyani, na minyolo yendile imwezisingo ze izingamia zawo. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidiyoni kajeseza ivintu ivyo kudamanya tukulu dya zahabu niyo adika mo mzi wakwe wa Ofula. Waizulaeli wose niyo wamleka Zumbe waita uko wadivikila. Tukulu idyo niyo dyatenda mtego kwa Gidiyoni na wantu we ikaya yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Elo, Wamidiyani niyo wahudiswa hawawatisize naho Waizulaeli. Isi ya Izulaeli niyo yatenda na utondowazi kwa mihilimo milongo mine.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gidiyoni, uyo Yelu Baali mwana ywa Yoashi, niyo auya kwekaya yakwe nakwikala uko. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidiyoni endaga na wana chilume milongo mfungate, kwaviya asolaga wavyele walozize. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Endaga na chilaga chakwe uko komzi wa Shekemu, keleka naye mwana zina dyakwe kamwitanga Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidiyoni mwana ywa Yoashi kabanika akatenda na mihilimo ilozize, niyo ahambwa mwe mbila ya ise Yoashi, komzi wa Ofula wa Wabiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />File ya Gidiyoni ize iheze Waizulaeli niyo wawiya kuvikila milungu ya Baali. Wamtenda Baali Beliti mnungu ywawo. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Waizulaeli niyo wamjala Zumbe Chohile ywawo, uyo awakombole kulaila mwa awankondo wawo walozize wendile wazunguluka ntendele zose. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Hata hegu Yelu Baali kadamanya yedi wantu we inyumba ya Yelu Baali, uyo Gidiyoni, kuligana na yedi yose awatendele Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Abimeleki, mwana ywa Gidiyoni niyo aita komzi wa Shekemu kwa walukolo wa mami yakwe, awagamba, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Longani ahano kulongozi kwa wantu wose wa Shekemu, Togolani! Ni mbuli ikuwatamila, kugamba mlongozwe ni wana wose wa chilume milongo mfungate wa Yelu Baali hegu mlongozwe ni mwana yumwenga? Naho kumbukani kugamba miye ni sakame yenyu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Walukolo wa mami yakwe niyo walonga ulosi uwo kwa wantu wose wo umzi wa Shekemu hantu hakwe. Wantu wose wa Shekemu niyo wasagula kumtimila Abimeleki kwaviya ni mlukolo ywawo. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Niyo wamwinka vihande vya chumbu milongo mfungate vyendaga mwenyumba ya Baali Beliti, Chumbu icho kaliha wantu wakwakwa na wantu wahezi watongelezane naye. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Niyo atimilizana nawo waita kwekaya ya ise uko Ofula, niyo awakoma walukolo wakwe wose milongo mfungate mwe yuwe dimwenga. Mna Yotamu, mwana chiziwanda ywa Yelu Baali nakasigaila, kwaviya nakefisa.<verse eid="JDG 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Wantu wose wa Shekemu na Beti Milo niyo wadugana hemti ukwitangwa mwaloni wihajihi na mnala uko Shekemu, wamtenda Abimeleki seuta ywawo.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu eze eve imbuli iyo, niyo aita akuchimala kulanga kolugulu lwa Gelizimu, alonga kwa izwi kulu agamba, “Nyuwe wantu wa Shekemu netegelezani, hegu mwaunga Chohile awetegelezeni. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Zuwa dimwenga miti yaitaga ikalonde seuta. Elo, niyo yaugamba mzaituni, ‘Tenda seuta ywetu’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Mna mzaituni uwo niyo waigamba, ‘Mwafanyanya kugamba nadaha kuleka ndimangu ya kulavya mavuta yakungiswa ni milungu na wantu, nite hetumbwadise halongoza miti?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Vikaheza miti niyo yaugamba mkuyu, ‘Soo utende seuta ywetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Mna mkuyu niyo waigamba, ‘Togolani mwafanyanya nadaha kuleka ndimangu ya kweleka ntunda zangu zedi zimwile nite hetumbwadise halongoza miti?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Vikaheza miti niyo yaugamba mzabibu, ‘Soo weye utende seuta ywetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Mzabibu uwo, waigamba, ‘Togolani mwafanyanya nadaha kuleka ndimangu ya kulavya divai ikuwelela milungu na wantu, nite hetumbwadise halongoze miti?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Elo, imiti yose iyo iugambile umti wa imiwa, Soo weye utende seuta ywetu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Mti uwo we miwa waigamba imiti, “Hegu nyuwe mwanisagula chindedi nitende seuta ywenyu, soni mwikale mwe chizuli changu, mna hegu hakunga kudamanya ivyo, moto naulawe kwe miwa yangu utikimye hata imielezi ya Lebanoni.”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotamu niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Haluselo, mwafanyanya mumtenda seuta Abimeleki kwa kunga kwenyu na ukanuni? Togolani, mwafanyanya mumtendela yedi Yelu Baali na wantu we inyumba yakwe saviya vimuwagile kwa ntendwa zakwe? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Kumbukani tate kawambaza wikazi wakwe kwa kuwagombelani nkondo na kuwakombolani kulaila mwe imikono ya Midiyani! <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Mna dyelo muwebunga wantu we inyumba ya tate na kuwakoma wanawe milongo mfungate mwe yuwe dimwenga, nyuwe mumwika Abimeleki mwana ywa msunta viya ywa tate atende seuta mwa awantu wa Shekemu kwaviya du ni mntu ywa lukolo lwenyu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Haluselo, hegu mdamanya ivyo kwa moyo uchumile na kumtunya Yelu Baali na wantu we inyumba yakwe, elelwani hamwenga na Abimeleki, naye elelwe mwenyu. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Mna hegu sivyo ivyo, moto na ulawe kwa Abimeleki na kutikimya wantu wa Shekemu na Beti Milo, naho moto ulawe kwa wantu wa Shekemu na Beti Milo umtikimye Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Yotamu kasumkila Beeli, kakwikala uko, kwaviya kamogoha mlukolo ywakwe Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki kalongoza Izulaeli kwa chipindi cha mihilimo mitatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Vikaheza, Chohile niyo egala ulemani mgati mwa Abimeleki na wantu wa Shekemu, wantu wa Shekemu niyo wamhituka Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Ivyo nivyo wakantilwe wantu wa Shekemu na mlukolo ywawo Abimeleki kwa kuwakoma wadya awana milongo mfungate wa Yelu Baali. Nkanto ya ukomi iwagwela kwaviya Abimeleki awakomaga awantu awo akambizwa ni wantu wa Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Wantu wa Shekemu waika wantu kwevinenengwe vya amagulu chani wanyatile na kumwebunga wantu wakujinka na kuwahoka ugoli wantu wose wajinkile uko. Abimeleki niyo agambilwa ulosi uwo.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Zuwa dimwenga Gaali mwana ywa Ebedi, hamwenga na walukolo wakwe waita wakwikala Shekemu. Wantu wa Shekemu niyo wamzumila. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Niyo wafosa waita kwemigunda yawo ye izizabibu, wazisuma na kuzifumbula wadamanya divai na kudamanya ngasu. Wengila mndani mwe nyumba ya mnungu ywawo wadya na kunywa niyo wamhuluta Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali mwana ywa Ebedi niyo agamba, “Abimeleki ni yuhi? Suwe hano Shekemu chiwantu wavivihi vikuleka chimsankanile Abimeleki? Togola! Suyo mwana ywa Yelu Baali? Na Zebuli suyo mwambizi ywakwe? Elo, wasankanileni wantu wa Hamoli, ise dya Shekemu akongile ulukolo ywenyu, mna, msekumnkanila Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Hegu nahawalongoza wano awantu nasimusa Abimeleki. Nasimgamba Abimeleki, ‘Jenyeza awagomba nkondo wako, ukaheza wize mo lumpe chitowane.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli chilongozi ywa umzi uwo, eze eve ulosi wa Gaali mwana ywa Zebuli, niyo emukwa ni maya vitendese. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Niyo asigila wantu wegale ulosi kwa Abimeleki uko Tolima agamba, “Gaali mwana ywa Ebedi, hamwenga na walukolo wakwe wengila komzi wa Shekemu wawasonga maya wantu wakuhituke weye. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Haluse, weye na wantu mwi wose uyani nechilo mkefise kwezinkonde hajihi no mzi. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Mtondo zuwa dikatontomoka, webungeni umzi. Gaali anafosa hamwenga na awantu wakwe kutowana na weye, mdamanye vikuwagila.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleki hamwenga na awantu wakwe wahalawa waita Shekemu nechilo, kawasanga mwe mabunga mane wefisa hajihi nomzi. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Gaali mwana ywa Ebedi niyo afosa kuse, achimala henchili yo mzi, chipindi icho Abimeleki na awantu wakwe nawafosa kulaila ahantu wefisize.<verse eid="JDG 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali eze awawone niyo amgambila Zebuli, “Kaula, wantu wasela kulaila kulunenengwe lwa magulu.” Zebuli amgamba, “Weye wawona vizuli vya amagulu uge viya ni wantu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaali niyo alonga naho, “Kaula! Wantu wasela mwe isi, bunga tuhu dyalaila ntendele yomti wo mwaloni wa Walaguzi.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Zebuli niyo amgamba, “Kweduvya kwako kuhela hahi? Weye siweye ugambile, ‘Abimeleki ni yuhi, vikuleka chimsankanile?’ Haluse wantu awo nawo wabeile hita ukatowane nawo.”<verse eid="JDG 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaali niyo afosa awalongoza wantu wa Shekemu, atowana na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Gaali niyo ahudwa asumka, Abimeleki niyo amgulusa. Wantu walozize walumizwa niyo wagwa mwesila kubula kwechili yo mzi. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki niyo ekala Aluma, Zebuli niyo ambalaza Gaali na walukolo wakwe, wasekwikala Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Zuwa ditimile, Abimeleki niyo eva ulosi kugamba wantu wa Shekemu wafosa komzi waita kwezinkonde. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Niyo awaguha awantu wakwe, awasanga mwemabunga matatu, chani waite wakawebunge kwezinkonde. Eze awawone wantu wafosa komzi niyo afosa kulaila uko efisize niyo awakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki ne idibunga dyakwe niyo waguluka waita wakuwagoja kwechili yo mzi. Mabunga yakwe matuhu maidi yawebunga wadya wendile kwezinkonde niyo wawakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleki katowana na awantu womzi uwo msi mjima. Niyo autaha umzi uwo awakoma wantu wendile umo. Niyo autimpa moto na kuujela munyu.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Wantu wose nawakekala kwengome ya Shekemu weze weve ulosi uwo niyo wasumkila kwe nchingo ye nyumba ya mnungu ywawo akwitangwa Eli Beliti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki niyo agambilwa kugamba wantu wose wendaga kwengome wa Shekemu wechisanya hamwenga. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleki na awantu wakwe niyo waita kolugulu lwa Solimoni, kaguha hoya niyo akanta tambi dya mti adihagata mwediyega dyakwe. Niyo awagamba awantu awo wendile hamwenga naye wasunguze kudamanya seivyo adamanye yeye. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Chila yumwenga niyo akanta tambi sadiya dya Abimeleki. Waguha amatambi yawo wayegamiza mwezinkuta ze ilago, niyo wayatimpa moto wayoka ingome wantu wose wagosi kwa wavyele wakubula elufu imwenga umwenga wendaga kwengome wa Shekemu niyo wabanika.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Naho, Abimeleki aita komzi wa Tebesi, wautandama umzi uwo na kuutaha. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Mna kwendaga na mnala utogese hagatigati homzi. Elo, wekazi wose wo mzi uwo wagosi kwa wavyele wasumkila uko na kwevugaila mndani. Wakwela kwedihala dyo umnala uwo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki kausogeila uwo umnala chani awewebunga akaheza asogeila ulwivi lo uwo umnala chani autimpe moto. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Mvyele yumwenga niyo alagaza yuwe dya kusagila, dyamhonda Abimeleki mo mtwi. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Abimeleki niyo asunguza kumwitanga uyo mbwanga nakamwinuila iviziha vyakwe, amgamba, “Somola idibamba dyako, unikome, wantu wanasekugamba sikomwa ni mvyele.” Mbwanga uyo niyo asomola idibamba dyakwe amtunga, niyo abanika. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Wantu wa Izulaeli weze wawone kugamba Abimeleki kabanika, niyo wafosa wauya chila mntu kwenyumba yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Ivyo nivyo Chohile amkantile Abimeleki kwa ubanasi wakwe kwa ise kwa kuwakoma walukolo wakwe milongo mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Ivyo Chohile kawaliha wantu wa Shekemu kwa wihi wawo wadamanye. Ivyo, ligito dya Yotamu mwana ywa Yelu Baali dyawagwela.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Abimeleki eze abanike, niyo Tola mwana ywa Pua, mwana ywa Dodo, mntu ywa kabila dya Isakali atenda mlamuzi kuwakombola Waizulaeli. Tola nakekala Shamili, mwe isi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Uyo katenda mlamuzi mwa Waizulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo midi na mitatu, niyo abanika ahambwa uko Shamili.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Tola eze abanike, niyo Yaili mntu ywa Giliyadi atenda mlamuzi mwa Waizulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo midi na midi. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yaili endaga na wana chilume milongo mitatu nawakakwela mpunda milongo mitatu, nawo wendaga na mizi milongo mitatu mwe isi ya Giliyadi kubula vino dyelo mizi iyo yetangwa Hawati Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili niyo abanika ahambwa uko Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Wana wa Izulaeli niyo wakola masa vituhu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, wasankanila Mabaali na Mashitolati na milungu ya Alamu na milungu ya Sidoni na milungu ya Moabu na milungu ya wana wa Amoni na milungu ya Wafilisiti. Wamleka Zumbe Chohile hawamvikile vituhu. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Zumbe Chohile niyo emukwa ni maya mwa Waizulaeli, niyo awaleka wahudye ni Wafilisti na Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Wawasulumiza kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga na mnane na kuwazila Waizulaeli nawakekala uko Giliyadi hantu ha Waamoli ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa wo umto wa Yolidani. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Waamoli nawo niyo wadeluka umto wa Yolidani wagomba nkondo na wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Benjamini na wantu wa Efulaimu. Waizulaeli wenkwa nkunto vitendese.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Waizulaeli niyo wamwilile Zumbe Chohile wamgamba, “Suwe chikola masa kwako kwaviya chikuleka weye Chohile ywetu, chasankanila Mabaali.” <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awagamba Waizulaeli, “Togolani, siwakomboleni kulaila mwa Wamisili na Waamoli na Waamoni na Wafilisiti, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />na Wasidoni na Waamaleki na Wamidiyadi wawazileni? Mnilila niyo nawakombolani kulaila mwawo. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Mna mnileka mwasankanila milungu mituhu. Ivyo, kwachausa icho saniwakomboleni vituhu. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Hitani mkailile iyo imilungu msagule. Lekani iyo iwakomboleni mwezinkunto zenyu.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Mna Waizulaeli wamgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Chikukola masa. Chidamanye ivyo ukunga, mna chakulombeza chikombole vino dyelo.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Niyo waidula hale imilungu ye chijeni, wamsankanila Zumbe Chohile vituhu. Zumbe Chohile hajendeleze kujijimiza kuwona nkunto za Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Waamoni nawechisanya waika lago dyawo uko Giliyadi. Waizulaeli nawo niyo wechisanya waika lago dyawo uko Misipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Vilongozi wa wantu wa Giliyadi wauzana, “Akunga akonge kutowana na Waamoni ni yuhi? Nadamanye ivyo nuyo natende chilongozi ywa wekazi wose wa Giliyadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Uko Giliyadi kwendaga na mgomba nkonda mkankalu hekogoha akwitangwa Yefuta, mami yakwe endaga mchilanga, ise naketangwa Giliyadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Iviya uyo Giliyadi endaga na wana watuhu mo mvyele ywakwe asoile. Wana wa uyo mkaziwe weze wakule niyo wambalaza Yefuta hanyumba, wamgamba, “Weye huna uwagilwa wa kwinkwa chochose kulaila kwa tati yetu, kwaviya wi mwana ywa mvyele mtuhu.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Ivyo, Yefuta niyo awasumka walukolo wakwe aita akwikala kwesi ikwitangwa Tobu. Uko wantu wakwakwa niyo wechisanya hamwenga na Yefuta, wamtimila chila hantu aitile akakugomba nkondo.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Chipindi chisiku chize chijinke Waamoni niyo wawebunga Waizulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Umo nkondo ikagombwa, wadalahala wa Giliyadi niyo waita wakumguha Yefuta kulaila kweisi ya Tobu, <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />wamgamba “Soo uchilongoze mo kugomba inkondo na Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Mna Yefuta niyo awagamba awo wadalahala wa Giliyadi, “Togolani, nyuwe hamwanihiwaga na kunibalaza nifose mwe ikaya ya tate? Ni mbwani mkunizila vino haluse mwimwe nkunto?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Wadalahala awo wa Giliyadi wamgamba, “Nivyo vikuleka chikubasa chani chijesanye chikagombe nkondo na Waamoni chinahuda weye nautende chilongozi mwetu na mwawantu wose wa Giliyadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta awagamba wadalahala wa Giliyadi, “Uneva chinaita wose kaya hagombe nkondo na Waamoni, Zumbe Chohile ananinka uhuda mwa Waamoni, miye nanitende chilongozi ywenyu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Wadalahala wa Giliyadi wamgamba Yefuta, “Zumbe Chohile natende mukuzi mgati mwetu. Chindedi nachitende seivyo ulongile.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Yefuta niyo atimilana na awo wadalahala wa Giliyadi, wantu niyo wamtenda chilongozi. Kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile uko Misipa, Yefuta niyo awiya kulonga mbuli zose ziya awagambile wadalahala.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Yefuta niyo asigila walosi waite kwa seuta ywa Waamoni amgamba, “Una nkumbizi yani vikuleka kwiza kuyebunga isi yetu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Seuta ywa Waamoni niyo awahitula awo walosi wasigilwe ni Yefuta, “Waizulaeli umo walawaga kwe isi ya Misili, waguhaga isi yangu kukongela komto wa Alinoni kubula komto wa Yaboki na umto wa Yolidani. Haluse nivuziza isi iyo kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta niyo asigila walosi nkanana ya kaidi waite kwa uyo seuta ywa Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />Mgambileni, “Waizulaeli hawaguhile isi ya Wamoabu hegu isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Mna umo Waizulaeli walawaga Misili, watambaga kwedijagwa niyo wabula kwebahali ya Shamu wajendeleza, kubula Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Waizulaeli niyo wasigila walosi waite kwa seuta ywa Edomu, wamlombeza awaleke wajinkile mwe isi yakwe, mna seuta ywa Edomu niyo alemela. Niyo wamlombeza seuta ywa Moabu awaleke wajinke, iviya naye niyo alemela. Elo, Waizulaeli niyo wasigala uko Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Niyo watamba wajinkila kwedijangwa kuzunguluka isi ya Edomu, na isi ya Moabu vyaleka wabula ntendele ya ulailo wa zuwa we isi ya Moabu, niyo waika lago ntendele ya kaidi yo umto wa Alinoni. Mna hawengile mndani mwe isi ya Moabu. Umto wa Alinoni nuwo wendaga umhaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Aho, Waizulaeli niyo wasigila walosi waite kwa seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli uko Heshiboni, wamlombeza awaleke wajinkile mwe isi yakwe waite kweisi yawo. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Mna Sihoni hawazumile Waizulaeli wajinkile mwe isi yakwe. Elo, Sihoni niyo awachisanya awantu wakwe wose, waika lago uko Yahasa, awebunga Waizulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, niyo amtenda Sihoni na wantu wakwe wose wahudye ni Waizulaeli, Waizulaeli wawahuda niyo waguha isi yose ya Waamoli wendaga wekazi weisi iyo. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Waguha hantu hose ha Waamoli, kukongela Alinoni kubula Yaboki na kukongela kwedijangwa ntendele ya ulailo wa kubula komto wa Yolidani ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, nuyo awabalaze Waamoli kwachausa cha Waizulaeli. Togola, waunga uchihoke isi yetu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Zumila chiya winkigwe ni mnugu ywako Kemoshi. Mna si yoyose idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, aguluse awekazi wakwe niyo achinka suwe, iyo ni si yetu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Togola weye wafanyanya kugamba una udahi kumjinka Balaki mwana ywa Zipoli endaga seuta ywa Moabu? Uyo hahigane hegu kugomba nkondo na Waizulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Chipindi chose Waizulaeli nendile wakekala komzi wa Heshiboni ne vijiji vyakwe, na umzi wa Aloeli ne vijiji vyakwe hamwenga ne imizi yose impezo mo mto wa Alinoni kwa mihilimo magana matatu ni mbwani hamuikombole iyo isi ichipindi icho? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Miye sikubalange chintu, ukanebunga wabalanga. Zumbe Chohile, nuyo mlamuzi nalamule vino dyelo mgati mwa Waizulaeli na wantu wa Amoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Mna seuta ywa Amoni niyo abela ulosi uwo wa Yefuta amwigaile.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Muye wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwizila Yefuta, niyo ahalawa ajinkila Giliyadi na Manase, auya Mizipa mweisi ya Giliyadi na kujendeleza kubula Amoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta niyo elisa kwa Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Uneva weye unaninka uhuda mwa Waamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />elo chochose nachifose kulaila mwenyumba yangu kudugana na miye umo hauya haheza kuwahuda Waamoni, icho nachitende chako weye Zumbe Chohile. Icho nahulavize jeleko dya kutikimya.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Elo, Yefuta niyo adeluka umto agomba nkondo na Waamoni. Zumbe Chohile niyo awatenda Waamoni wahudye ni Yefuta. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Kenkigwa uhuda mkulu, niyo ataha mizi milongo midi yendile Aleoli mzunguluke Miniti na Abeli Kelamimu. Elo, Waamoni niyo wahudwa vitendese ni Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Umo Yefuta akauya kwekaya yakwe uko Mizipa, mchiche ywakwe niyo afosa amsingila akavina na kutoa kagoma. Mchiche uyo endaga nuyodu mwana ywa Yefuta. Yefuta hendaga na mwana mtuhu ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefuta eze amwone niyo amolola suche zakwe kwa chinyulu, amgamba, “Hoi mwanangu! Kunijela chinyulu vitendese. Weye winkongelo nkulu ya nkunto zangu. Selisa kale kwa Zumbe Chohile naho sikudaha kuhituila icheliso changu.” <verse eid="JDG 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Mchiche uyo amgamba, “Tate, uneva kumwelisiza chintu Zumbe Chohile, nidamanyiza seivyo welisize, kwaviya haluse kakudahiza kulihiza chikoda awankondo wako Waamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Niyo amgamba ise, “Nakulombeza chintu chimwenga, ninka chipindi cha myezi midi, chani nite nawambuya zangu kwamagulu halomboleze ifile yangu kwaviya sanisolwe kusolwa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Ise niyo amleka aite uko kwa myezi midi. Niyo aita na wambuyaze walomboleza ifile yakwe kwaviya hasolwe. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Myezi midi ize iheze auya kaya, ise niyo amdamanya saviya elisize. Mchiche uyo endaga henati kujenda na mgosi yoyose. Elo, kukongela aho, niyo kwatenda na mazwela yano mwa Waizulaeli; <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />chila mhilimo wachiche wa Izulaeli waita wakulomboleza kwa mazuwa mane kumkumbuka mchiche ywa Yefuta uko Giliyadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yefuta na wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu nendile wadugana, niyo wadeluka umto wa Yolidani wabula uko Zafoni. Niyo wamgamba Yefuta, “Ni mbwani huchitange chitanye chikagombe nkondo na Waamoli? Haluse nyumba yako chaitimpa moto hamwenga na weye mwenye mndani.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta awagamba, “Miye hamwenga na wantu wangu chendaga na nkumbizi ikulise na wantu wa Amoni. Nawetangani mwize mnambize mna hamwizile kunikombola. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Nize niwone hamwizile kunikombola, sita hawambaza ujima wangu hagombe nkondo na Waamoni, Zumbe Chojile niyo aninka uhuda mwawo. Haluse ni mbwani mweza kugomba nkondo na miye?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Elo, Yefuta niyo awachisanya wantu wose wa Giliyadi, agomba nkondo na wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu. Wantu wa Giliyadi niyo wawahuda wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu. Wantu awo we idikabila dya Efulaimu, nawo wagambaga, “Nyuwe wantu wa Giliyadi mwiwanyika mwe idikabila dya Efulaimu mlaile mwe idikabila dya Efulaimu niyo mwengila mwe idikabila dya Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Wantu wa Giliyadi watahaga ivyomboko vyo mto wa Yolidani chani wachinde isila ya wantu we idikabila dya Efulaimu. Chila nkanana akalaila mnyika akalombeza kujinka uko, wantu wa Giliyadi wamuza, “Togola! Weye wi mntu we idikabila dya Efulaimu?” Hegu anahitula, “Bule.” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />Wamgamba, “Longa ulosi uno, ‘Shiboleti’ ” Mna uyo alonga “Siboleti” Kwaviya Waefulaimu wadunduga kulonga vyedi ulosi uwo. Aho wamgwila na kumkoma uko kwevyomboko vyo umto wa Yolidani. Wantu elufu milongo mine na magana maidi we idikabila ywa Efulaimu wakomagwa ichipindi icho.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefuta niyo atenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli chipindi cha mihilimo mtandatu. Yefuta eze abanika, niyo ahambwa uko Giliyadi komzi wakwe.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibuzani na Eloni na Abudoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Yefuta eze ajike, Ibuzani kulaila Betelehemu niyo atenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Uyo endaga na wana chilume milongo mitatu na wana chiche milongo mitatu. Wanawe awo we ichiche awalozaga kwenkolo ntuhu ukaleka ulukolo lwakwe, wanawe we ichilume niyo awalozeza wandele milongo mitatu kulaila kwenkolo ntuhu ukaleka ulukolo lwakwe. Ibuzani atendaga mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo mfungate. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ibuzani niyo abanika, ahambwa uko Betelehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Ibuzani eze abanike, Eloni kulaila kwe idikabila dya Zabuloni niyo atenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Eloni niyo abanika, ahambwa komzi wa Aiyaloni kweisi ye idikabila dya Zabuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Eloni eze abanike, Abudoni mwana ywa Hileli, kulaila Pilatoni, niyo atenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Uyo endaga na wana chilume milongo mine, na wezukulu milongo mitatu, nawakakwela mpunda milongo mfungate. Katenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo mnane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Abidoni mwana ywa Hileli, niyo abanika, ahambwa uko Pilatoni kwe idikabila dya Efulaimu, kweisi ya amagulu ya Amaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kwelekwa kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Waizulaeli niyo wadamanya wavu vituhu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, naye niyo awaleka walongozwe ni Wafilisiti kwa mihlimo milongo mine.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga uko komzi wa Sola kwe idikabila dya Dani, zina dyakwe nuyo Manoa, mkaziwe nendile hena wana kwaviya nendile ni mgumba. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Zuwa dimwenga mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile niyo amlaila uyo mvyele, amgamba, “Weye wimgumba, hweleke wana. Mna notende msoka na kwefungula mwana chilume. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Ivyo, kaulisa, usekuywa divai hegu chintu chikukola, naho usekudya chintu chochose hechikuzumilika nachikutende usekuzumilika kumvikila Chohile, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />kwaviya, notende msoka nakwefungula mwana chilume, fili za uyo mwana usekuziwegula kwaviya uyo natende kasentwa kwachausa cha Chohile kukongela kwelekwa kwakwe. Uyo nakonge kuwakombola Waizulaeli mwe mikono ya Wafilisti.” Kaula Uwazwa sula ya 6:21.<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Mvyele uyo niyo aita akumgambila mgosiwe, “Mntu ywa Chohile mta uso ukutisisa saviya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile kanizila. Simuzize uko alaile, naho hanigambile idizina dyakwe. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Mna kanigamba, ‘Nanitende msoka na kwefungula mwana chilume. Kanilagiza nisekunywa divai hegu chintu chocho hachikuzumilika mwesila yo kumvikla Chohile, kwaviya mwana uyo natende kasentwa kwachausa cha Chohile kukongela mo kwelekwa kwakwe kubula aho nabanike.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Elo, Manoa niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile, amgamba, “Nakulombeza, weye Zumbe Chohile, msigile vituhu yudya mntu ywako usigile chani achihinye mbuli chikungwa chimtendele uyo mwana akunga elekwe.” <verse eid="JDG 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Chohile niyo amwiva Manoa, mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe niyo aita vituhu kwa yudya mvyele umo nendile kekala kwenkonde, mna mgosiwe Manoa nendile hehamwenga naye. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Mvyele uyo niyo asunguza aita akumgambila mgosiwe, “Kaula! Yudya mntu anizilaga zuwa diya kanizila vituhu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa niyo enuka amtongela mkaziwe kubula kwa yudya mntu, niyo wambwila, amuza, “Togola, weye ni weye ulongile na yuno mvyele?” Amgamba “Heye, ni miye.” <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manoa niyo amgamba, “Haluse ulosi wako ukabula, togola ni mbuli zani nachitimile kwachausa cha uyo mwana?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohole amgamba Manoa, “Mkaziwo aungwa atozese yada nimgambile. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Asekudya chochose chilaile mwe mzabibu, naho asekunywa divai, hegu chintu chikukola, hegu kudya chintu chochose hechikuzumilika mo kumvikila Chohile. Atimile mbuli zose nimgambile.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa niyo amgamba uyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile, “Hampu goja hadodo chikamalanye kabehela kwachausa chako.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Mndima uyo ywa Zumbe Chohile, amgamba Manoa, “Hata hegu ninagoja sanidye nkende yenyu. Mna hegu waunga, malanya malavyo ya kutikimya mlavize Zumbe Chohile.” Manoa nendile havimanyize kugamba uyo ni mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Manoa niyo amgamba uyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe, “Chigambile idizina dyako chani aho ulosi wako ukabula chikutunye.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Mndima uyo ywa Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Kwambwani waunga umanye idizina dyangu? Kwaviya zina dyangu nidya kwehela.” <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Manoa niyo amalanya kabehela, hamwenga na lavyo dya unga avika halanga he luwe amlaviza Zumbe Chohile adamanye maula. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Elo, umo Manoa na mkaziwe wakasinya imwale yo moto ikakwela kulanga kulaila hadya he nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, wamwona mndima uyo ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile mwe mwale iyo akwela aita kulanga. Ivyo, Manoa na mkaziwe niyo wafunamiza izinyuso zawo kubula hasi. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Manoa niyo abunkula kugamba uyo ni mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Zumbe Chohile. Mndima uyo ywa kwembingu hawalaile naho Manoa na mkaziwe.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoa amgamba mkaziwe, “Chindedi nachibanike, kwa viya chimwona Chohile.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Mna makaziwe niyo amgamba, “Hegu Zumbe Chohile aungile kuchikoma hahokele idilavyo dyetu dyo kutikimya hegu lavyo dyo unga, naho hachilagise mbuli izo hegu kuchigambila malagizo.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Ivyo, mkaza Manoa niyo efungula mwana chilume, Manoa niyo amwinka zina dya Samsoni. Mwana uyo niyo akula, Zumbe Chohile niyo amjimbika. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Muye wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wakonga kumjele nguvu umo akatenda ekomzi wa Mahane Dani, hagati ha Sola na Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na mvyele kulaila Timna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Samsoni nakaseleza aita Timna, uko niyo awona mndele yumwenga Mafilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Eze auye kaya kwa awelesi wakwe niyo awagamba “Siwona mndele yumwenga Mfilisiti uko Timna. Nilozani uyo mndele.” <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Mna welesi wakwe wamgamba, “Togola, hahana mndele yoyose mgati mwa awalukolo wako, hegu mgati mwa wantu wetu wose, vikuleka wite ukasole kwa Wafilisiti hewevinilwe?” Samsoni amgamba ise, “Niloza uyo, kwaviya kanitamila vidala.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Welesi wa Samsoni nendile hawavimanyize kugamba uwo nendile ni mzungu wa Zumbe Chohile nakalonda luhosa chani alihize chikoda kwa Wafilisiti. Chipindi icho Wafilisiti nendile wakawalongoza Waizulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Elo, Samsoni na welesi wakwe niyo waseleza waita Timna. Weze wabule uko kwezinkonde ze mizabibu, niyo kwalaila zana simba dyambumila Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Chipumpa udahi wa Zumbe Chohile niyo amtenda Samsoni atende nanguvu, niyo amtatula kwa mikono yakwe saviya atatula kabuzi. Samsoni hawagambile welesi wakwe imbuli iyo. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Niyo abula Timna akulonga na yudya mndele, mndele uyo kamungisa Samsoni.<verse eid="JDG 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Mazuwa majeche yeze yomboke, niyo auya uko Timna akumguha yudya mndele. Akatenda emwesila niyo apaguka hampezo akaule ichimba cha idya isimba, akaule kwendaga na nyuchi zidamanye uchi mndani mwe ichimba che isimba. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Niyo alunda uchi kwa mikono yakwe, niyo adya uchi kuno ajendeleza ne intambo yakwe. Eze auye kwa awelesi wakwe niyo awenka uchi mjeche niyo wadya, mna hawagambile kugamba uchi udya kaulunda mwe chimba cha simba. <verse eid="JDG 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Ise niyo aita kwenyumba ya uyo mndele, Samsoni niyo adamanya ngasu uko, saviya nawakadamanya wabwanga chipindi icho. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Wafilisiti weze wamwone niyo wamwigaila wabwanga milongo mitatu ekale nawo kwe ngasu. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni niyo awagamba, “Naniwafyambileni lufyambo. Mnadaha kulufyambula ulufyambo ulo mwa mazuwa yano mfungate ye ngasu ye nyinka, elo, miye naniwenkeni suche milongo mitatu za chitambala chedi ching'aile na suche ntuhu milongo mitatu ze ngasu. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Mna hamnadahile kulufyambula, nyuwe namninke suche milongo mitatu za chitambala chedi ching'aile na suche ntuhu milongo mitatu ze ngasu.” <verse eid="JDG 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Niyo wamgamba, Ni vyedi, chifyambile chive. Samsoni niyo awagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Kwa mta kudya kulawa nkande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">Kwa mta nguvu kulawa mwile.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Mazuwa matatu yeze yajinke wabwanga awo nendile hawanati kulufyambula ulufyambo ulo.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Ivyo, zuwa dya mtandatu, wamgamba mkaza Samsoni, “Mhembeleze mgosiwo, chani achigambile ulufyambo ulo, hegu sivyo chakuchulika moto weye na wantu we inyumba ya iso. Togola! Mchigoneka hano chani mchihoke ugoli wetu?” <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Mkaziwe Samsoni niyo ambasa mgosiwe, akalenga lenga mesozi, amgamba, “Weye hukununga, wanihiwa du, wantu wangu kuwafyambila lufyambo, wenawe fyambulo dyakwe hunigambile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Somsoni niyo amgamba, “Welesi wangu wenye siwagambile, haluse weye nahugambile vivihi?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Mna niyo ajendeleza kwila kwa mazuwa yose yasigale mwa mazuwa yose ye ngasu ye nyinka. Zuwa dya mfungate Samsoni niyo amgambila mkaziwe fyambulo dyo ulufyambo ulo kwaviya kamlahiliza vitendese. Mkaziwe niyo asunguza kwita akuwagambila wantu wakwe. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Zuwa dya mfungate, zuwa hedinati kuhunga, niyo wamgambila Samsoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ni chintu chani chimwile kujinka uchi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Ni chintu chani chenye nguvu kujinka simba?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:18">Samsoni awagamba, “Hamwamuzize mkazangu, lufyambo lwangu hamwaludahile kulufyambula.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Chipumpa udahi wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwizila chinguvu Somsoni, niyo aita komzi wa Ashikeloni, akoma wantu milongo mitatu, niyo aguha izisuche zawo ze ngasu, awenka wadya wafyambule ulufyambo lwakwe. Niyo ahalawa chimaya maya aita kwa welesi wakwe. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Ivyo, mkaziwe Samsoni niyo alozwa kwa mbwanga mtuhu endaga mmbuya mwe nyinka ya Samsoni.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Chipindi chisiku chize chomboke, umo wantu wakavuna ingano, Samsoni niyo aguha kabuzi aita amtalamkila mkaziwe. Amgamba mkwewe kugamba aunga amuwone mkaziwe kwe chumba. Mna mkwewe niyo amlemeza.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Mkwewe niyo amgamba Samsoni, “Miye nahafanyanya kumfika. Ivyo simloza kwa mmbuya ywako. Mna mvunamntu ni mtana kujinka lumbudye, hampu msole uyo hantu hakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni agamba, “Ntambo ino sanitende na mlema kwa yadya hunga niwadamanyize Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Samsoni niyo aita akugwila mauzi magana matatu, niyo ayanyinya imichila yawo chahamwenga maididi. Niyo aguha magala ya moto niyo ayanyinya mwe michila ya ayo amauzi maididi. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Niyo ayachulika moto ayo amagala, ayalekela amauzi ayo, niyo yengila mwezinkonde za Wafilisiti, yatikimya amaiso ye ingano, aho ngano nendile heinati kuvunwa ne izinkonde ze mizabibu ne mizaituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Wafilisiti weze waunge wamanye adamanye ivyo ni yuhi, niyo wagambilwa, “Samsoni, mkwelima dya yudya mntu alaile Timna, kadamanya ivyo kwaviya uyo mkwewe kamloza mkaziwe kwa mbwanga yumwenga endaga mmbuya ywa Samsoni mwe nyinka.” Wafilisiti niyo waita wakumchulika moto uyo mvyele na tati yakwe.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni niyo awagamba Wafilisiti, “Hegu ayo nayo mdamanye, nelisa kugamba sanihalawe kubula silihiza chikoda.”<verse eid="JDG 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Ivyo, niyo awebunga vitendese na kukoma walozese. Niyo aita akwikala kwe mpanga ya luwe lwa Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni awahuda Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Wafilisiti niyo waika lago dyawo komzi wa Yuda, na kuzagala kubula komzi wa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Wantu wa Yuda niyo wawauza, “Ni mbwani mwiza kuchebunga?” Wawahitula, “Chiza chani chimgwile Samsoni, chimdamanye saviya achidamanye.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Ivyo wantu elufu magana milongo mitatu wa Yuda niyo wambasa Samsoni kwempanga yo luwe lwa Etamu, wamgamba, “Togola! Humanyize kugamba Wafilisiti wachilongoza suwe?, Kaula imbuli uchidamanyize!” Samsoni niyo awahitula, wagamba, “Iviya wanitendile nivyo niwatendele.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Wamgamba, “Chiza chikufunge chani chikwinkize kwawo.” Samsoni awagamba, “Nelisizani kugamba nyuwe wenye hamnikome.” <verse eid="JDG 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Niyo wamgamba, “Suwe hachikukome, mna nachikufunge du, na kukwinkiza kwawo.” Elo, niyo wamfunga kwa sigi mbili pya, wamlavya umo mwempanga.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Eze abule Lehi, Wafilisiti niyo wamgulukila wakatula lwasu. Chipumpa udahi kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamjela nguvu Samsoni, ziya izisigi wamfungile mwemikono yakwe niyo zakantika saviya uzi wokigwe moto, ziya izisigi niyo zahambuka zagwa hasi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samsoni niyo awona vuha dya lusaya lubisi lwa mpunda, kalujeseza kukomela wantu magana mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Samsoni niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa lusaya lwa mpunda, sikoma wantu magana mlongo umwenga.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa lusaya lwa mpunda, sichisanya vyuga vya vimba.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Eze abinde ukulonga niyo adula ludya ulusaya. Hantu aho niyo hetangwa Lamati Lehi, kugamba lugulu lwa lusaya.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Vikaheza, Samsoni niyo atozeswa ni nchilu. Niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile, akagamba, “Weye Chohile ni weye uninkile uhuda uno mkulu, kwa kujeseza miye mndima ywako. Togola, haluse nonileke nibanike kwa nchilu, na kutahigwa ni wano Wafilisiti hewejeligwe ngasu?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Chohile niyo avugula hantu hendile na bome uko Lehi, ajuluza mazi. Samsoni niyo anywa ayo amazi, nguvu zakwe niyo zamuwiya. Sokwe iyo niyo yetangwa En Hakole, nivyo kugamba kamto ka mntu akuvika. Sokwe iyo iyuko Lehi kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsoni katenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo midi, chipindi cha Wafilisiti.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni uko Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Samsoni aitaga komzi wa Gaza, kadugana na mvyele mchilanga niyo agona naye. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Wantu wo umzi wa Gaza weze wagambilwe kugamba Samsoni eyuko, niyo watandama ahantu aho wamgoja henchili yomzi chilo chijima. Wakafanyanya kugamba wadaha kumgoja kubula kukacha chani wamkome. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Mna Samsoni kasigaila komzi kubula chilo gati. Chize chibule chilo gati niyo enuka atoza ifulemu ye nchili aing'ola hamwenga na awapete wakwe ainula aita nayo kubula hajihi na umzi wa Hebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Ayo yeze yajinke, Samsoni niyo atamilwa ni mvyele yumwenga akwitangwa Delila, uyo nakekala kwedibwandasi dya Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Vilongozi wa Wafilisiti niyo wambasa Delila wamgamba, “Mhembeleze Samsoni chani umanye izinguvu zakwe zilozese chani chidahe kumgwila na kumnyinya. Unadamanya ivyo, chila yumwenga ywetu nakwinke vihande vya mayuwe ya chumbu elufu magana mlongo na imwe.” <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila niyo amgamba Samsoni, “Hampu nigambila idikolwa dye izinguvu zako, naho mntu adaha kukuhuda vivihi na kukunyinya.” <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni amhitula, “Wananinyinya na ngole mbisi mfungate, aho nanisokele saviya mntu yoyose.” <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Vilongozi wa Wafilisiti niyo wamwigaila Delila ngole mbisi mfungate za uta, niyo amnyinya nazo. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila nakaika wantu wamwebunge kwechumba chituhu. Niyo amwitanga, “Samsoni, Wafilisiti sawo weza kukwebunga.” Samsoni niyo azidumula izisigi izo saviya uzi ukuhya mwe moto. Ivyo, hahana abunkule idikolwa dye izinguvu zakwe.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila amgamba Samsoni, “Weye kunitila, naho kunidanta. Hampu nigambila ivyo ukudaha kunyinywa.” <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsoni amhitula, “Wananinyinya na sigi pya hezijeseze kunyinya chintu chochose, nanitende msokezi saviya mntu yoyose.” <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Ivyo, Delila niyo aguha sigi pya amnyinya nazo. Niyo amwitanga Samsoni, “Samsoni, Wafilisiti weza kukwebunga.” Akalonga ivyo, kwendaga na wantu kwechumba wefisize. Samsoni niyo azikanta izo izisigi saviya ukonje.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila amgamba Somsoni, “Kubula haluse uchei kunitila, na kunidanta, nigambila ivyo ukudaha kunyinywa.” Samsoni amgamba, “Unashuka yano amabutu mfungate ye izifili zangu ukaheza yanyinye kwa chitambala cha suche na kuyanyinya mwe mti wa kusumila suche, nanitende msokezi saviya mntu yoyose.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Umo Samsoni agonile, Delila niyo ayashuka chahamwenga yadya amabutu mfungate ye izifili za Samsoni, ayanyinya vitendese kwa chitambala cha suche mwe mti wa kusumila suche. Eze aheze amgamba Samsoni, “Wafilisiti weza kukwebunga.” Samsoni enuka mwe izintongo, ang'ola udya umti wo kusumila izi suche na kutatula chiya ichitambala che suche.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila amgamba Samsoni, “Vyadahika vivihi ugambe wanunga, kubula haluse hukunga kunigambila idikolwa dye zinguvu zako? Kunitila ino ni nkanana ya katatu. Hunigambile idikolwa dye izinguvu zako.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila kajendeleza kumviga viga Samsoni kwa milosi chila zuwa, vibule gati Samsoni niyo asokela, afanyanya kugamba nabanike, <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />vyamtenda adunduga kujijimiza ambunkuila idikolwa dye izinguvu zakwe, amgamba, “Fili zangu hazawegulagwa. Miye sisentwa kwa Chohile kukongela nikwenda ya mnala. Hegu ninawegulwa nguvu zangu nazusike, nantende msokezi saviya mntu yoyose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Ivyo, Delila eze amanye kugamba Samsoni kamgambila idikolwa dye izinguvu zakwe, niyo awetanga vilongozi wa Wafilisiti awagamba, “Soni nkanana inodu imwenga kwaviya Samsoni kanigambila idikolwa dyose dye izinguvu zakwe.” Vilongozi wa Wafilisiti niyo waita kwa Delila wakatenda wanaziya izihela wamwelisize. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Delila niyo amgoneza Samsoni mwamavindi yakwe, etanga mntu amwegule yadya amabutu yakwe mfungate. Delila niyo akonga kumsulumiza Samsoni kwaviya nguvu zakwe zimlawa. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila niyo amgamba Samsoni! “Samsoni Wafilisiti weza kukwebunga!” Samsoni niyo enuka mwezintongo akafanyanya nekombole saviya akutendaga. Havimanyize kugamba Zumbe Chohile kamwasa. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Wafilisiti wamgwila niyo wamng'ola ameso yakwe wamwigala komzi wa Gaza, wamnyinya kwa mpingu za shaba, wamkunduganya adamanye ndima ya kubunda unga kwedijeleza. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Mna fili zakwe niyo zakonga zakula vituhu eze aheze kuwegulwa.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Vilongozi wa Wafilisiti nawadugana chani wamlavize ntambiko mnungu ywawo akwitangwa Dagoni. Elo, niyo wachema, “Mnungu ywetu kachinka udahi wa kumhuda mnkondo ywetu Samsoni.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Wakatenda wamema mbwedo mwemyoyo yawo, niyo wagamba, “Chileteleni Samsoni kuno chani avine chibwede.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:24">Ivyo, niyo wamlavya Samsoni kwedijeleza, wamwigala avine. Wamwika hagati hezinguzo. <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Wantu weze wamuwone Samsoni niyo wamtunya mnungu ywawo wakagamba, mnungu ywetu kachinka udahi vilekile chimhuda mnkondo ywetu nakabalanga isi yetu na kukoma wantu wetu walozize. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga nendile akamlongoza, “Nilekela nihahase izinguzo zegamilwe ni dino idizumba chani nizegamile.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Idi zumba idyo nadimema wantu. Vilongozi wose wa Wafilisiti naweyaho, kulanga kwedihala kwendaga na wantu magana milongo mitatu wagosi kwa wavyele wakamsinya Samsoni akavina.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Aho, Samsoni niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile, “Nakulombeza nikumbuka. Ninka udahi nkanana inodu imwenga, weye Chohile, chani niwalihize chikoda wano Wafilisiti waning'oile ameso yangu yose maidi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samsoni niyo atoza izinguzo mbili za hagati zegamilwe ni idizumba, mkono umwenga nguzo ino mkono mtuhu nguzo ya kaidi. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Niyo agamba, “Leka nibanike hamwenga na Wafilisiti.” Niyo asindika kwa nguvu zakwe zose. Zumba idyo niyo dyawagwela vilongozi awo wose wa Wafilisiti wendile umo mndani. Samsoni kakoma wantu walozize kujinka wadya akomile umo emjima. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Walukolo wakwe na wantu we zikaya zakwe wose niyo waita wakumguha, wakumhamba hagati hemizi ya Sola na Eshitaoli mwembila ya Manoa tati yakwe. Samsoni endaga mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo midi.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Ditukulu dya Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Chipindi icho nendile kuna mntu yumwenga weisi ya wagulu ya Efulaimu, zina dyakwe nuyo Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Zuwa dimwenga niyo amgamba nine, ivyo ivihande vya mayuwe ye chumbu magana mlongo na gana dimwenga ubailwe, izo uligite kwa chausa chakwe nakuno hakwetegeleza, kaula, nnanavyo ivyo ivihande ni miye niviguhile. Nine niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu Zumbe akujimbike kwaviya kuzumila.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Ivyo niyo amvuziza nine ivyo ivihande magana mlongo na gana dimwenga chani unase kugwelwa ni ligito. Nine niyo amgamba, “Miye nazika vino ivinde vitende vya Zumbe, chani vidamanywe tukulu dya kusongola udigubikwe kwa vihande vya mayuwe ya chumbu, ivyo nakuvuziza weye.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Ivyo niyo amwinka nine ivyo ivihande magana maidi, viligana na chilo imwenga unusu amwinka fundi ywa kusana mayuwe ya chumbu, naye niyo adamanya tukulu dya kusongola na kudigubika kwa mayuwe ya chumbu, na tukulu dya kusana, izo nazikwe nyumba ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Ivyo mntu uyo Mika nandile ana hantu hakuvikila milungu, naye niyo adamanya kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa, na matukulu ya milungu, niyo amsenta yumwenga mgati mwa wanawe, atenda mlavyantambiko ywakwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Amazuwa ayo nandile hahana seuta mwa Izulaeli, chila mntu nakadamanya yadya akuwona ni yedimwa meso yakwe mwenye.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Nandile kuna mntu yumwenga mbwanga Mlawi nakekala Betelehemu mweisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Mbwanga uyo niyo afosa mo mzi uwo kakulonda hantu hatuhu hakwikala, mwentambo yakwe niyo abula kwe nyumba ya Mika mwawagulu wa Efulaimu <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika niyo amuza, “Weye walawa kuhi?” Amgamba, “Miye ni Mlawi ywa Betelehemu mweisi ya Yuda, miye nalonda hantu hakwikala.” <verse eid="JDG 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika niyo amgamba, “Chikale chose, utende kwangu tate, naho mlavyantambiko, miye nahwinke vihande mlongo vya mayuwe ya chumbu chila mhilimo, na suche ya kuvika, na nkande.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Mbwanga uyo Mlawi niyo azumila kwikala na Mika, ukajika mbwanga uyo niyo atenda saviya yumwenga ywa wanawe dya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Mika niyo amsenta mbwanga uyo Mlawi, amsenta atende mlavyantambiko ywakwe, mbwanga uyo niyo ekala mwe nyumba ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Mika niyo agamba, haluse, “Simanya kugamba Zumbe nanidamanyize yedi, kwaviya nina yuno mbwanga Mlawi saviya mlavyantambiko ywangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mika na idikabila dya Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Mwa mazuwa ayo nendile hahana seuta mwa Izulaeli, naho mwa mazuwa ayo wantu we dikabila dya Dani nendile dikalonda hantu hawo hakwikala, kwaviya kubula idizuwa idyo nandile hawadahile kwingila mwe isi wenkigwe. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Ivyo, wantu we idikabila dya Dani niyo wasagula wantu wakankalu washano kulaila mwezinkolo zawo, wawasigila kulaila Sola na Eshitaoli chani waite wakaipelembe iyo isi. Elo, wantu awo niyo wabula kwe isi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu, kwenyumba ya Mika niyo wagona uko. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Umo wakatenda we mwenyumba ya Mika, niyo wabunkula izwi dya yudya mbwanga Mlawi, niyo wamhitukila wamuza, “Akwigale kuno ni yuhi? Kuno watenda mbwani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Niyo awahitula, “Sivana na Mika, aniliha nitende mlavyantambiko ywakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Niyo wamgamba, “Hampu chuzize kwa Chohile, chimanye uko chikwita hegu nachikachumilwe.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Mlavyantambiko awagamba, “Ni vyedi jendani mpeho, Zumbe awadimeni mwesila.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Wantu awo washano niyo waita zawo, wabula Laishi, niyo wawawona wantu awo nawekekala umo viya wakwikala kwa utondowazi saviya wantu wa Wasidoni. Wendaga watondowala hewena nkumbizi na mntu. Naho wendaga na chila chintu wakunga. Wekalaga hale na Wasidoni naho hawalondile mbuli za wantu watuhu. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Wakajika niyo wawawiya walukolo wawo uko Sola na Eshitaoli, walukolo wawo niyo wawauza, “Hayani, mna mbuli yani?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Wagamba, “Hainukani, chite chikatowane nawo, kwaviya chiwona isi sanga yakwe ihola, msekwekaila du? Halikoni chite chikaiguhe iyo isi itende yetu. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Aho namwitile nambwile wantu wakwikala kwa utondowazi, isi iyo nayo ni nkulu, kwaviya Chohile kawenkani iyo isi.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ivyo niyo wafosa wantu magana mtandatu wolukolo lwa Dani wavikile viziha vya nkondo, kulaila Sola, na kulaila Eshitaoli. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Wakwela kulanga na kwika lago uko Kiliyati Yaelimu, mweisi ya Yuda. Nivyo vikuleka ahantu aho, ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa wa Kiliyati Yealimu hetangwa Mahane Dani kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Niyo wajinka uko kubula isi iyo ya wagulu wa Efulaimu, waibwila inyumba ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Naho wadya awantu washano wetile kuipelemba isi ya Laisha wawagamba walukolo wawo Togolani! “Nyuwe mvimanya kugamba mna kasuche kakugubi mwechifuwa mndani mwe nyumba imwenga mwezinyumba zino, na tukulu na matukulu ya kusongola, na tukulu dya kusana? Haluse fanyanyani vikungwa mdamanye.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ivyo niyo wahituka waita uko, waita kwenyumba ya Mika wengila kwenyumba ya uyo mbwanga Mlawi na kumlamsa. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Chipindi icho wadya awankondo magana mtandatu kulaila kwedikabila dya Dani wakatenda neviziha vyawo vya nkondo, nawachimala, niyo wachimala he nchili. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Wadya wantu washano wetile kuipelemba isi idya niyo wengila kunyumba, waguha diya iditukulu dyo kusongola na, na kadya akasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa, na diya iditukulu dyo kusana. Chipi icho mlavyantambiko nendile kachimala kwenchili hamwenga na awo wagomba nkondo magana mtandatu wata kuvika viziha vya nkondo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Ivyo mlavya ntambiko awawonaga wakengila mndani mwe inyumba ya Mika, na kuguha ichinyago cho kusongola, na akasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa na diya iditukulu, neditukulu dyo kusana, mlavyantambiko niyo awauza, “Togolani nyuwe mwadamanya mbwani?” <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Wamgamba, “Weye nyamala, usekulonga mbuli yoyose, utende mlavyantambiko ywetu naho saviya tati yetu. Hegu wagaze? Togola! Ni vyedi kwako kutenda mlavyantambiko ywa mntu yumwenga hegu kutenda mlavyantambiko ywa kabila dimwenga dya Izulaeli?”<verse eid="JDG 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Uyo mlavyantambiko niyo elelwa vitendese, aguha kadya akasuche kakubika mwechifuwa na diya iditukulu na yadya amatukulu yo kusongola, aitanya na awo awantu.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Ivyo wahituka waita zawo, kuno wana wadodo na wanyama wawo we mifugo, na viya vyawo, viwalongoila. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Weze watende wehale ne nyumba ya Mika, Mika awetanga wantu wehaguhi naye, wawatimila wantu awo wedikabila dya Dani niyo wawabwila. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Wawatwila lwasu wantu wedikabila dya Dani. Niyo wahituka wamgamba Mika, “Weye una mbwani ukeza na fyo dya wantu sadino?” <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika niyo ahitula, nyuwe mguha imilungu nidamanye, na uyo mlavya ntambiko ywanyu, nanywi mnasa ni bule. Ivyo nyuwe mwanuzizani, “Weye unambwani? <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Wantu awo we idikakabila dya Dani wamgamba, Ni vyedi ukenyamaila. Unase kuleka wantu wetu watuhu wata maya wakakwebunga na kukukoma weye na awantu wako.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ivyo Mika eze awone ahudwa niyo ahituka auya kaya na awantu we idikabila dya Dani niyo waita zawo.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Niyo waguha chiya adamanye Mika, na mlavya ntambiko nandile ananaye niyo wabula Laisha, kwandile na wantu wata mbwedo na utondowazi. Niyo wawatowa kwa mabamba wauchulika moto umzi wawo. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Mna nandile hahana mkombozi, kwaviya mzi uwo nani hale vidala na mzi wa Sidoni, nawo nandile hawana mbuli na mntu yoyose, mzi uwo nandile wi mwe bwandasi dihajihi na Bete Hobu. Wantu weidikabila dya Dani niyo wauzenga uwo mzi wekala umo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Mzi uwo niyo wawitanga zina dyakwe Dani, wawitanga zina dya babawo Dani endaga mwana ywa Yakobo, mna mwe nkongo mzi uwo nendile uketangwa Laisha. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Ukajika wantu weidikabila dya Dani niyo wachimalisa idyo iditukulu dyo kusongola, na uyo endile mlavya ntambiko Jonasani mwana ywa Geshomu, mwanawe dya Musa nuyo endaga mlavyantambiko na welekwa wakwe iviya wendaga walavyantambiko we idikabila dya Dani kubula eze wasamizwe. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Ivyo niyo wechimalisiza iditukulu idyo dyo kusongola didamanywe ni Mika, chipindi chose che Idihema Dikukile dya Chohile nendile diyuko Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mlawi na mvyele chilaga chakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Mwa amazuwa ayo, kwendaga hekwine seuta mwe isi ya Izulaeli, kwendaga na Mlawi msiku nakekala saviya mjeni hale ntendele ya amagulu ye isi ya Efulaimu. Mntu uyo aguhaga mvyele chilaga chakwe kulaila Betelehemu mwe isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Mna chilaga uyo niyo akonga kujenda uyaga na wantu watuhu ukaleka uyo Mlawi, amwasa auya kukaya kwa tati yakwe uko Betelehemu, kekala uko chipindi cha mwyezi mine. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Zuwa dimwenga mgosiwe aitaga kumlonda, kafanyanya akalonge naye vyedi chani amvuze kaya kwakwe. Ivyo mgosi uyo aitaga na mndima ywakwe na mpunda mbili. Ivyo, eze abule kwekaya tati yakwe, mkaziwe eze amuwone niyo amhokela, mkwewe niyo amhokela kwa chinyemi. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Mkwewe niyo amgoneka, niyo ekala uko kwa mazuwa matatu, Mlawi uyo na umndima ywakwe, wadya na kunywa niyo wagona uko. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Zuwa dya kane, niyo wenuka mtondo, wemalanya chani wahalawe, mkwewe niyo amgamba, “Jela gunda mazi upate imijendele ukalawa aho namwite.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Ivyo wantu awo waidi niyo wekala, wadya na kunywa hamwenga, Ukajika mkwewe amgamba yudya Mlawi, “Hampu, gona hano chino ichilo ubwede.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Yudya mntu eze enuka chani aite, mkwewe niyo amlahiliza asekwita, niyo haitile. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Zuwa dya shano mntu uyo niyo enuka mtondo chani aite. Mna mkwewe niyo, agamba, “Jela gunda mazi upate imijendele, ugoje msi ukalawa aho nawite.” Ivyo, wose waidi niyo wadya hamwenga.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Ivyo mntu yudya eze enuke aite zakwe, yeye na mkaziwe, na mndima ywakwe, mkwewe, ise dyo mvyele, amgamba, “Kaula msi wihaguhi na kisingi, hampu ikala ichilo chose, gona ahano chani moyo wako welelwe, kubula luvi mtondo wite zako kwenyu.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Mna yudya mntu niyo alemela kwikala ichilo icho, mna niyo enuka, aita zakwe, abula haguhi na Yebusi, nuwo Yelusalemu, nandile ehamwenga na mpunda mbili zitandazwe vilago, mkaziwe yudya chilaga na wewose.<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Weze watende wehajihi na Yebusi, msi naujendesa, yudya mndima niyo amgamba sekulu ywakwe, “Hampu, chihituke hankanda chingile mo mzi uno wa Wayebusi, chigone umo.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Mna sekulu ywakwe amgamba, “Suwe hachihituke kwingila mzi wa wajeni, suwo wa Izulaeli, mna nachijinke chibule Gibeya.”<verse eid="JDG 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Niyo ajendeleza kulonga nomndima ywakwe, “Chihikilize chibule Gibeya hegu Lama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Ivyo niyo watoza isila kwita kulongole, zua niyo dyawaswela wehajihi na Gibeya, uwo ni mzi wa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Niyo wengile chani wagone mo mzi wa Gibeya, mna nendile hahana mntu yoyose awagoneke kunyumba, niyo wakugona kolwazo lo mzi.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Umo wachei uko mdalahala yumwenga niyo eza alaila kwenkonde yakwe. Mdalahala uyo endaga mwikazi ywe isi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu, nakekala uko Gibea saviya mjeni. Wekazi wo umzi wa Gibeya wendaga ni wantu wa kabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Uyo mntu mdalahala eze asinye, amuona mntu uyo akutamba mwe sila nkulu yo umzi, mdalahala uyo niyo amuza, Weye waita kuhi? Nawe walaila kuhi?<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Amgamba, “Suwe chajinka hano kulaila Betelehemu mweisi ya Yuda, chaita uko ntendele ya hale ya isi ya wagulu ya Efulaimu. Nuko hwikala haluse nauya mwe ntambo kulaila Betelehemu kweisi ya Yuda, naita kaya hano hahana mntu achigoneke mwekaya yakwe, <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />hata hegu suwe china chila chintu, mani ye izimpunda zetu na divai kwachausa changu na yuno mndima ywangu na yuno mvyele chilaga ywangu.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Mdalahala uyo niyo agamba, “Utondowale nakugoneka kwekaya yangu, mna yano yakuhungukile naniwenkeni, mna msekugona mo lwazo luno.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Niyo engila naye kwekaya yakwe, azinka mani izimpunda, nawo niyo wasunta iviga vyawo, wadya na kunywa.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Weze webwedeze, kaula wantu wo mzi uwo manyakwili wayebunga iyo inyumba ntendele zose, watunta ulwivi. Walonga na mta inyumba, uyo mdalahala wamgamba, “Mlavye kuse uyo mgosi ezile mwekaya yako chani chigone naye!”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Uyo mta ikaya niyo awalaila aho heise awagamba, “Bule, havikudahika, walukolo wangu. Naweilani msekutenda wihi sa uwo, kwaviya mntu yuno kengila mwe nyumbangu, msekudamanya uhezi uno. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Kaulani, mchiche ywangu ehano ni mwali hemanyize mgosi, na mtumwa chilaga ywa yuno mjeni ywangu, lekani niwalavye kuse muwatende seivyo mkunga, mna mntu yuno msekumdamanya mbuli yo uhezi saiyo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Mna wantu awo walemela kumwiva, ivyo mntu uyo niyo amtoza yudya chilaga ywakwe, na kumlavya kuse kwawo, niyo wamkakalisa na kumgonya na kumdamanyiza uhezi chilo chose kubula mtondo kwize kukonge kukuzuka wamleka aite zakwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Chilochilo mvyele uyo niyo auya henyumba endila sekulu ywakwe agwa hasi ho lwivi, kekala aho kubula kucha. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mtondo sekulu ywakwe niyo enuka avugula izinyivi ze inyumba aite zakwe. Chipumpa ambwila yudya mvyele mtumwa msuntaviya ywakwe kagwa hadya ho lwivi he inyumba, mikono yakwe na ihe chifigwe <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Amgamba, “Inuka chite zetu.” Mna hahana amhitule, niyo amwinula amwika mlanga mwe mpunda, mntu uyo niyo ahalawa, aita kwekaya yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Eze engile kwe inyumba yakwe, niyo aguha ngola, niyo amtoza uyo mvyele chilaga ywakwe, amsenga vihande mlongo na vidi amwigala chila chihande kwa chila kabila dya Waizulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Ivyo chila yumwenga awone imbuli iyo agamba, “Haa! Mbuli ino hainati ilaile hegu kuwoneka kukongela zuwa idyo wana waizulaeli walaile kweisi ya Misili kubula dyelo, ifanyanyeni, damanyani chitala, chigambilane chintu cho kudamanya.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wemalanya kwa nkondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Wantu wose wa Izulaeli, kukongela komzi wa Dani kubula Beli Sheba, hamwenga na wantu we isi ya Giliyadi, chahamwenga wantu wose wadugana uko Misipa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Vilongozi wose wa amakabila ya Izulaeli walaila homdugano wa wantu wa Chohile. Kwendaga na wagomba nkondo magana gana milongo mine wata mabamba.<verse eid="JDG 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Ivyo wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo weva ulosi kugamba wadya awantu awatuhu wa Izulaeli wendaga wechisanya uko Misipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Ivyo, Waizulaeli niyo wamuza yudya mgosi Umlawi, “Chigambile uwo ubanasi udamanywa vivihi?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Yudya Mlawi, mgosiwe dya yudya mvyele chilaga akomigwe, ahitula, agamba, “Miye na mvyele chilaga ywangu nachibula komzi wa Gibeya, mzi wa kabila dya Benjamini, chani nechilo chigone uko. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Mna wantu wo umzi wa Gibeya niyo wanibasa nechilo, watandama inyumba nigonile ntendele zose. Nawakonga wanikome, wamgonya mvyele uyo kubula abanika. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Miye niyo naguha ichimba chakwe namkantakanta vihande, na kwigala chila chihande kwa kabila dya Izulaeli, kwaviya wadamanya mbuli ikwihiza naho ya ubanasi mwa Izulaeli <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Haluse nyuwe Waizulaeli, lafyani chani mlavye ulamuzi wenyu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Wantu wenukila chalumwe, wachimala wagamba, “Hahana hata yumwe mwetu nauye kwedihema dyakwe hegu kwenyumba yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Vino nivyo nachiudamanyize umzi wa Gibeya. Nachitowe tegatega chani chisagule ni kabila dihi nadikawebunge umzi wa Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Nachisagule wantu mlongo umwenga mwe chila wantu gana wa Izulaeli na wantu gana dimwenga mwe chila wantu magana mlongo, na wantu magana mlongo mwe chila wantu elufu mlonga. Awo ndima yawo naitende ni kuwegaila nkande weyawe nawatende na ndima ya kuwatowa awantu womzi wa Gibeya mweisi ya Benjamini kwa wavu wawo na ubanasi wadamanye mweisi ya Izulaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Ivyo, wagosi wose wa Izulaeli niyo wadugana kwa moyo umwenga chani wawebunge umzi wa Gibeya.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Wantu wa amakabila ya Izulaeli niyo wasigila walosi mwe chila hantu heidikabila dya Benjamini, wakagamba, “Togolani! Ni ubanasi wani uno ulaile mgati mwenyu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Haluse chinkeni awantu awo wakwakwa wadamanye ubanasi uwo wihise chani chiwakome, chuse ubanasi uno mweisi ya Izulaeli.” Mna wantu we idikabila dya Benamini hawawetegeleze walukolo wawo Waizulaeli watuhu. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Mna wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wechisanya uko Gibeya kulaila mwe chila mzi wawo chani wagombe nkondo na Waizulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini wagomba nkondo wezile kulaila mwe imizi yawo wendaga elufu milongo midi na mtandatu wakujeseza mabamba, wekazi wo umzi wa Gibeya niyo wachisanya wantu magana mfungate wasagulwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Wantu womzi wa Gibeya wasagula wantu magana mfungate wakujeseza mamoso, chila yumwenga nakadaha kudula ngumbayuwe kwa supatu na kutaila fili naho hakuihonya.<verse eid="JDG 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Wantu wa Izulaeli, ukausa wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini, wachisanya wantu elufu magana mane wakankalu wa nkondo. Wose wendaga wakankalu wa kugomba nkondo.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli watuhu wagomba nkondo na Wabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Waizulaeli niyo waita Beteli wakamuze Zumbe Chohile, chani wamanye kugamba ni kabila dihi dikunga dikonge kugomba nkondo na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini. Zumbe Chohile niyo ataja idikabila dya Yuda nidyo nadikonge. <verse eid="JDG 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Elo, Waizulaeli niyo waita mtondo na kwika lago dyawo hajihi nomzi wa Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wafosa chani wagombe nkondo na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini hajihi na Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wafosa kuse komzi wa Gibeya wagomba nkondo na Waizulaeli, zuwa idyo wakoma Waizulaeli elufu magana milongo midi na milongo midi. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Mna wantu wa Izulaeli, wajele moyo, wemalanya kwa nkondo nkanana ya kaidi hantu ahadya wemalanye nkanana ya nkongo. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Umo hewenati kwita kwenkondo, Waizulaeli niyo waita hantu hakuvikila wamlombeza Zumbe Chohile kubula chisingi. Vikaheza wamuza Zumbe Chohile wagamba, “Togola, chite chikagombe nkondo vituhu na walukolo wetu we idikabila dya Benjamini?” Zumbe Chohile niyo awahitula, “Kwelani mkagombe nkondo nawo.”<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Ivyo zuwa dya kaidi Waizulaeli niyo wasogela wagombe nkondo na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini nkanana ya kaidi. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wafosa kutowana nawo kulaila Gibeya zuwa dya kaidi, niyo wawakoma wantu elufu mlongo umwenga na magana mnane mwa Waizulaeli weyawe, wose awo nawakajeseza mabamba.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Niyo wagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli wakwela waita Beteli. Wekala ha meso ya Zumbe waila na kufunga idizuwa idyo kubula chisingi, walavya malavyo ya kubalanga na malavyo ya utondowazi ha meso ya Zumbe. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Waizulaeli niyo wamuza ulangilizi Zumbe uko Beteli. Chipindi icho Shanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile dyendaga uko Beteli, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finehasi, mwana ywa Eleazali, mwana ywa Haluni, nendile nuyo mlavyantambiko. Waizulaeli niyo wamuza Chohile wagamba, “Togola! Chifose naho chite chikagombe nkondo na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini walukolo wetu, hegu chileke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Zumbe awagamba, “Hitani kwaviya luvi naniwadahizeni muwahude.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ivyo wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli niyo waika wantu waunyatile umzi wa Gibeya wauzunguluka ntendele zose. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Niyo Waizulaeli wakwela waita wakutowana na wantu wa Benjamini zuwa dya katatu, wemalanya chani wautowe umzi wa Gibeya, saviya wadamanye mwe nkongo. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini weze wafose wagombe nkondo na Waizulaeli, wavutwa waite hale no umzi. Niyo vyalaiala saviya vilaile mwe nkongo wawakoma wantu wasiku wa Izulaeli mwezisila nkulu zikuhinga kwemizi ya Beteli na Gibeya kubula kwenyika. Wakoma Waizulaeli wakubula milongi mitatu.<verse eid="JDG 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wagamba, “Chiwatowa saviya nkongo.” Mna Waizulaeli niyo wagamba, “Suwe chisumkeni chani chiwavute waite hale wase umzi kubula kwe isila nkulu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Ivyo fyo dilozize dya wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli niyo wahalawa ahantu hawo wetumba vituhu uko Baali Tamali. Weyawe wendile wefisa niyo wasunguza kuhalawa ahantu hawo ntendele ya uswelo wa zuwa wo umzi wa Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Wagomba nkondo wakankalu magana gana wasagulwe kulaila mwa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli, niyo wabula aho halongozi houmzi wa Gibeya. Nkondo mwe idizuwa idyo yahimbaga. Mna wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini hawamanyize kugamba kubalangwa kwawo ibula. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awadahiza Waizulaeli wawahuda wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini. Waizulaeli wawakoma wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini elufu milongo midi na shano na gana dimwenga. Wose wakomigwe wendaga wagomba nkondo wata umanyi wa kujeseza mabamba. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ivyo wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wabunkula kugamba wahudya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Ivyo Waizulaeli wawahudile Wabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Waizulaeli niyo wauya kunyuma saviya kugamba wawasumka wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini, kwaviya nawakawekiya msuhi weyawe wendile wefisa wataile umzi wa Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Awo wata kunyatila niyo wasunguza, wawebunga umzi wa Gibeya na kukoma chila mntu kwa sime. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Ivyo chilagiso icho chilaganwe mwa awantu wa Izulaeli na wakuitala nendile ni chino; wadamanye ingu kulu dya mosi dikwele kulaila mo umzi uwo. Ivyo wawebunge umzi. Wantu wa Izulaeli weze wahituke mwe idya nkondo. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Chipindi icho wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini nendile wawakoma Waizulaeli milongo mitatu na kugambilana, “Chiwatowa saviya vya nkongo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Mna ichilagiso che idingu dyo mosi dize dikonge kukwela kulaila komzi, wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini wahituke kunyuma wehelwa wawona wawo watikima. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Niyo wantu wa Izulaeli wahituka, na wantu wa Benjamini niyo wetuka, kwaviya wawona file yawo ibula. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Ivyo niyo wahitula wawasumka Waizulaeli kuhinga kwedijangwa. Mna wadunduga kusumka inkondo, kwaviye webwila wemwabunga maidi ya wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli na wadya nawakataila. Wantu walaile kwemizi ya Waizulaeli ni wawakoma wantu wa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Waizulaeli wawatandama awantu we idikabila dya Benjamini wawagulusa kulaila Nowa komzi wa Gibeya na kukoma walozize mgati mwawo. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wakomwa elufu milongo mlongo na magana mnane, wose awo nani wagamba nkondo wakankalu. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Wantu watuhu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wahituka waguluka kuhinga kwedijangwa wabula koluwe lwa Limoni. Na wantu magana milongo mishano wakomwa mwesila umo wakasumka. Waizulaeli wajendeleza kuwabalazisa wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini kubula komzi wa Gidomu na kukoma wantu watuhu elufu milongo midi. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Wagomba nkondo wose we idikabila dya Benjamini wakomigwe mwe idizuwa idyo ni wantu elufu magana maidi na magana milongo mishano nandile wakajeseza sime, wose wendaga wagomba nkondo wakankalu. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Mna wantu magana mtandatu wahonaga mwe nkondo ni wasumkila kwedijangwa, waguluka wabula koluwe lwa Limoni, wekala ko uluwe ulo lwa Limoni chipindi cha myezi mine. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Niyo wantu Waizulaeli wawahitukila awantu awatuhu we idikabila dya Benjamini, wawakoma wose, wagosi kwa wavyele na wana na wanyama. Mizi yose wabwile uko niyo waitimpa moto.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s1">Wabenjamini walondelwa wavyele wakusola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Wantu wa Izulaeli nendile welisa uko Misipa, wakagamba, “Hahana mntu yoyose mwetu akunga amloze mchiche vywakwe mwe mntu ywe idikabila dya Benjamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Ivyo wantu awo niyo wabula Beteli, wahumula ha Zumbe Chohile kubula chisingi, wenuila izwi dyawo wailisa kwa chinyulu chitendese.<verse eid="JDG 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Wagamba, “Weye Zumbe, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, ni mbwani mbuli ino intende mwa Izulaeli, kugamba vino dyelo Waizulaeli chihungukilwa ni kabila dimwenga?” <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Zuwa ditimile, wantu awo niyo wenuka mtondo, uko niyo wazenga nchanja ya kulaviza ntambiko, walavya malavyo ya kutikimya na malavyo ya utondowazi. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Waizulaeli niyo wagamba, “Mwe yano amakabila yose ya Izulaeli ni dihi hedizile hechitala kumsogeila Zumbe?” Kwaviya nawaika cheliso kugamba mntu yoyose hanezile kulongozi kwa Zumbe, uko Misipa vyaungwa akomwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Waizulaeli niyo wengila chinyulu kwa chausa cha mlukolo ywawo Benjamini, wagamba, “Kabila dimwenga dyaga. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Suwe chitende zeze chani chiwenke wavyele awo wasigale, kwaviya chelisa kwa Zumbe kugamba hachiwenke wachiche wetu chani wasole?” <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Ivyo niyo waunga wamanye hegu kuna bunga dyodyose hedizile komdugano. Izulaeli hadibuile kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile uko Misipa, Niyo wabunkula, kulaila Yabeshi Gileadi hahana ezile ho mdugano uwo. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Kwaviya aho wantu wawazigwe uko Misipa, nandile hahana mntu hata yumwenga mwa wekazi wa Yabeshi Giliyadi. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Ivyo mdugano niyo wegala uko wantu elufu milongo midi wakankalu wa nkondo, wawasigila waite wakawakome wagosi wose na wavyele wose wasoligwe na wana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Mbuli mkunga mdamanye ni ino; “Komani chila mgosi, na chila mvyele agonile na mgosi.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Ivyo, weze waite mwa awekazi wa Yabeshi Gileadi nendile kuna wachiche hewenati kugona na mgosi wakubula magana mane, niyo wawegala kwa malago uko Shilo, wi mwe isi ya Kanani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Vikaheza mdugano niyo wasigila walosi wakalonge ulosi wa utondowazi na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini wendile uko koluwe lwa Limoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Wagosi awo we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wauya mwe ichipindi icho, wawenka awo wavyele wawalekile wajima mwa wavyele wa Yabeshi Giliyadi, mna hawawenele.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wawafila mbazi wantu wa idikabila dya Benjamini, kwaviya Zumbe kadamanya mpengo mwe izikabila za Izulaeli.<verse eid="JDG 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Wadalahala wo mdugano niyo wagamba, “Togolani! Chitende zeze chani chiwenke wavyele awo wagosi wasigaile, kwaviya wavyele wose we idikabila dya Benjamini wakomwa? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Vyawagila wagosi wasigale we idikabila dya Benjamini wenkigwe wavyele wajendeleze idikabila, chani kunase kwaga kabila dyodyose mwa Izulaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Mna suwe hachikudaha kuwaloza wachiche wetu kwaviya Waizulaeli nawelisa, wakagamba, ‘Naligitwe uyo akunga amloze mchiche ywakwe asolwe ni mgosi ywa kabila dya Benjamini.’” <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Niyo wagamba, “Kaulani, ngasu ya Zumbe ya chila mhilimo uko Shilo ihaguhi, mzi wi ntendele kwamwenyemzi ya Beteli, kweisila nkulu ikulaila Beteli kwita Shekemu na ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Lebona.” <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Niyo walagiza wagosi we idikabila dya Benjamini wakagamba, “Kefiseni mwe izinkonde ze mizabibu, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />kaulisani wandele wa Shilo umo wanafosa chani wavine mwe ngasu, nyuwe fosani mwe mizabibu, chila mntu akwile mkaziwe mwa wandele awo. Mkaheza uyani kweisi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Ukajika navitende, aho watati zawo hegu walukolo wawo, wakeza kulaha, nachiwagambe, ‘Suwe chaweilani wafileni mbazi wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini walekeni waguhe awo awavyele, kwaviya hachiwaguhile kwenkondo ya Yabeshi Giliyadi. Naho kwaviya nyuwe wenye hamchinkile wachiche wenyu, hamkantilwe kwaviya hambalange lagano.’?” <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Wagosi we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wadamanya saivyo, chila yumwenga kesaguila mchiche mgati mwa awachiche awo wafosize kuse wavine uko Shilo atende mkaziwe. Vikaheza niyo wauya kaya, wazenga uhya imizi yawo na kwikala umo. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Chipindi icho Waizulaeli niyo wauya chila mntu aita kwe idikabila dyakwe na kolukolo lwakwe hantu enkigwe.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Mazuwa ayo nandile hahana seuta mwa Izulaeli, chila mntu kadamanya yadya akuwona yamuwagila.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>